<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Yowani</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tsaangu Yimbwe ya Yowani</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yowani</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yow</para>
  <para style="mt2">Tsaangu Yimbwe ya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yowani</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="ip">Musamu wu Mubwe wa Yisu Kristo wu Yowani hasonehe, baatsindaha nde huli baatu ba tsi a Siriya na tsi ya Asiya, yi bali mu uteele Turikiya loloyi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muhanda a Yowani asobohono na Mataayi, Malako na muhanda a Luuka, mu tuungili a nde, na mu bitoyili. Yowani li mu umweese tsongo a matswehi ma mambu na mavaanga ma Yisu ali mu usa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ibadi hyatsomi hi Musamu (mu mabuli ma <char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1-12">1–12</ref></char>) hili mu umweese mavaanga tsambu ma kimuhili ma Yisu. Mavaanga ma bali mu uteele <char style="em">biliimbu</char>mu tooni ati, mo mali mu umweese ti Yisu li Mwana a Nzambi. Ibadi mo hinihi hili mu umweese kaka mambwanini ma Yisu na baatu. Ni we bu hu li mbwanini a na mukuutu ŋa hati li Bayudaayo (mu buli li<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 3">3</ref></char>), na mukaasu mumosi wa Samariya (mu buli li<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 4">4</ref></char>), na mbelusili babeedu (mu buli li<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 5">5</ref></char> na li<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 9">9</ref></char>). Mu ndongisili a nde, Yisu li mu umonehele we lipa li libaava moonyi, mukeelisi wu li mu ubita baatu huli Nzambi Taata. Nde li mu umonehele kaka we liyalala li libaayalusa tsi. Buuna Yisu li mu umweese huli boosi, na nde ali, na huni nde hamata.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ibadi hya byole (mu mabuli ma<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 13-21">13–21</ref></char>), hili mu uvangimasa na uyabisa<char style="em">taangu yi Yisu husiisa toto mu ufutaha huli Taata a nde</char>. Yisu li mu utoyo na bayihi ba nde, nde li mu uva bo madongi ma bo bu usalila ŋa nde hu ubweveleba na bo (mu mabuli ma<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 13-16">13–16</ref></char>). Humbisa, Yisu li mu usambila Nzambi, Taata a nde, na uyeholo nde bayihi ba nde (mu buli la <char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 17">17</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Tiili musamu a kwili a Yisu (mu mabuli ma <char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 18-19">18–19</ref></char>) yili mu ufwanina na tiili musamu yi Mataayi na ya Malako na ya Luuka, mu ngu musamu mumosi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Humbisa lipfu la nde, ilumbu hya Paake, Yisu amonihili ipakali huli bayihi ba nde: muutu wa moonyi (mu mabuli ma <char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 20-21">20–21</ref></char>)! Musonihi muhanda a Yowani li mu uleele bunuubu: nde hasonehe muhanda a nde, mana ba baavelemono Yisu, bo kaka basa imiinu mu nde (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 20:29-31">20.29-31</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Musamu wu Mubwe wa Yowani, li mu uyambila bunzuhisini mu<char style="em">Bayudaayo</char>, we kabu li laasobohono. Ikuma mo hinihi hili mu umweese ti baboho baa Yisu, homo bakuutu ba libundu ba bali iboho na Yisu. Yisu nde mwakulu li «Muyudaayo», bayihi ba nde baatsomi kaka, «Bayudaayo». Ŋa Yowani ali mu utoyo mu Bayudaayo, ikuma mo hiina a hili mu utoyo mu buli li Bayudaayo ve. Ka hyo hili mu umweese baatu boosi ba bali iboho na Yisu Kristo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Musamu wu Mubwe wa Yowani, a hali mu uyambila mbutili a Yisu, tso mu mbandihili idiingu hya nde ŋa hati la baatu ve. Ka mu kotili muhanda yinda, Yowani li mu ubindula ti <char style="em">Yisu Kristo ni Mukuma a Nzambi</char>, wu li na Nzambi umata mbandihili a tsi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1.1-18</ref></char>). Yisu, Mukuma a Nzambi, miiyatsahala ŋa hati la baatu. Bunuubu, baatu utwala mu ukituha baana ba Nzambi. Mu idiingi hya nde ŋa toto, Yisu li mu ukwilala mutso itwadi hi inono na Taata. Nde li <char style="em">iluumbi hya Taata</char> mu tsi. Boosi ba bali mu usaha Nzambi na litondo, utwala uyaba nde mu Yisu.</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Nziili Mukuma wu liyalala na wa moonyi mu tsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Ŋa mbandu hwaba na Mukuma. Mukuma aba itwadi na Nzambi. Mukuma aba ni Nzambi. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Buuna ŋa mbandu, Mukuma aba itwadi na Nzambi. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Byosi bi Nzambi havangi, nde avangi byo mu Mukuma. A hu li na isiha hi nde havangi hwavele Mukuma ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:3">Mba 1.3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:6">Mkg 33.6</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Mukuma aba ni suhu la moonyi. Moonyi mo wuuna aviidi liyalala huli baatu boosi. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Liyalala libaayalusa piipidi. Ka piipidi a yaatwali udimasa lo ve.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Nzambi atsindihi muutu nga nduhi Yowani. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Nde ayidi we mbangi, mu uyata imbangi mu liyalala, mana baatu basa imiinu mu lo. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Yowani a habeedi liyalala ve. Ka nde ayidi mu uta imbangi mu liyalala. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Liyalala mo liina laaba ni liyalala la mbuli a mbuli, li lili mu uya mu tsi. Lo lili mu uyalusa baatu boosi.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Mukuma aba mu tsi, na Nzambi avangi tsi mu nde. Ka baatu ba tsi a baadihuli nde ve. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Nde ayidi huli baatu ba nde, ka baatu ba nde a baayaki nde ve. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Ka boosi ba baayaki nde, na huli boosi ba baasiidi imiinu mu nde, nde aviidi bo muswa mu uba baana ba Nzambi. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Bo a bali baana ba Nzambi mu makila, buuve mu litondo li musunya ve, a tso mu litondo la muutu ve. Ka bo baabutimi baana ba Nzambi mu litondo la nde.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Mukuma akituhi musunya na nde atsahili ŋa hati la bisu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:6">Pal 33.6</ref></char></note>, wu aluula mu hyese na imbuli. Bisu laakengisi muyusu a nde, muyusu wu Mwana wu livingu ali mu uyaka huli Taata a nde. <verse eid="JHN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yowani atiili nde imbangi na asiidi ileedi mo hinihi: «Ni mu nde me anzambili ŋa me andeeli bunuubu: “Nde uya humbisa a me, ka nde akulala me, mu tooni ati nde abeedi moonyi tehele babuta me.”» <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Bisu boosi laayaki ikuuku hi busina bwa hyese hya nde. Nde ayitili bisu lisyeme li lilahi. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Ni mbuli, Nzambi asalili Moose<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 31:18">Pal 31.18</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:28">34.28</ref></char></note> mu uva bisu Mikele. Ka ni mu Yisu Kristo, Nzambi habehili bisu hyese na imbuli bya nde. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />A hu li na muutu wu amiimono Nzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:20">Pal 33.20</ref></char></note> ve. Ka ndulu Mwana wu livingu, wu li Nzambi na wu ubaatsahala ŋa tsoho a Taata, ni nde amweese bisu buni Nzambi ali.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imbangi hya Yowani Mutondihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Bakuutu ba Bayudaayo ba Yeruselemi, baatsindihi bangaanga ba Nzambi na basalili ba mu nzo a Nzambi huli Yowani. Bo baayafuula nde bunuubu: «We na we li?» Mono imbangi hi Yowani hatiidi. <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Nde a haabisi uva bo mvutu ve. Ka nde asilisi paayalala ŋa busu bwa boosi: «Me a handi Kristo ve.» <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Na bo baafuuli nde: «Ka we ka na li? We ni Eliya?» Nde afutili bo: «Naana, me a handi Eliya ve.» Bo baabwefuula nde bunuubu: «We ka mumbihuli wu Nzambi hu utsindaha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mumbihuli wu Nzambi hu utsindaha </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muutu wu uyayabisa nziili a Kristo </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Pfu 18.15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref></char>.</note>?» Na nde afutili ti «Naana!» <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Bunuubu, bo baafuuli nde: «Ka we ka na li? Bisu lafwana uva mvutu huli ba batsindihi bisu. We ki lo leeli mu we mwakulu?» <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yowani afutili bo ti: «Me ni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">ndaha a nde wuuna wu li mu uta ibila mu kumu a nzala:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">“Vangimasaani nzila yi yaasungama mu tooni a Pfumu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Esa 40.3</ref> </char></note>!”»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 1:23">Buuna ni bu mumbihuli Esaya haayabisi.<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Baatu ba baatsindihi huli Yowani, aba Bafarisi. <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Bo baabwefuula nde bunuubu: «Ka we mu hima we ubaatondehe baatu, tso we a hali Kristo ve, buuve Eliya, buuve mumbihuli wu Nzambi hu utsindaha?» <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yowani afutili bo bunuubu: «Me, me ndi mu utondehe benu mu mamba. Ka ŋa hati la benu, hu li na muutu wu benu laaveleyaba. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Nde uya humbisa a me, ka me a handi wu akuha mu unyangula mikudu mi bikoodi bya nde ve.» <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Maana moosi mavangimi hu Betanya, hu simu lina la Yolodani, hu Yowani hakatondehe baatu.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Ilumbu hi hyadukili, nde amoni Yisu mu uyiila nde. Yowani aleeli: «Monwaani Limeme la Nzambi li libaamaasa masumu ma baatu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:6-7">Esa 53.6-7</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Ni mu tooni a nde wunuuwu me andeeli: “Humbisa a me muutu mumosi li mu uya, ka nde akulala me. Mu tooni ati, nde ateehili me uba moonyi.” <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Me a hakanzaba nde ve. Ka me anzidi mu utondehe mu mamba, mana buli li Isereli liyaba nde.» <verse eid="JHN 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Yowani atiidi imbangi mo hinihi: «Me miimono Livupu la Ngidi mu ukulamana umata hu yulu mu ifwaani hi libembe, na utsahala ŋa yulu a nde. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Me a hakanzaba nde ve. Ka Nzambi atsindihi me mu utondehe mu mamba. Nde aleeli me bunuubu: “Nde wuuna wu we umono Livupu mu ukulamana na utsahala ŋa yulu a nde, ni nde wuuna utondehe mu Livupu la Ngidi.” <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Me miimono miina, buleeli Yowani, na me tiidi imbangi ti nde ni Mwana a Nzambi.»<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu uteele bayihi ba nde baatsomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Ilumbu hi hyakaduukala, Yowani ayafutaha ŋaana na bayihi ba nde boole. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Bu nde hamoni Yisu mu uvyoho, nde aleeli: «Monwaani Limeme la Nzambi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.36 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Limeme la Nzambi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ifwaani hi ibulu hi Abrahami hayehuli mu bungodu huli Nzambi </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 22:8">Mba 22.8</ref></char>.</note>!» <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Bayihi baboole baa Yowani baayuhi mambu mo maana, na baaduukili Yisu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yisu atali mbisa na amoni ti bo baakaduukala nde, na nde aleeli bo: «Benu hima lili mu usaha?» Bo baafutili: «Rabi, we huni ubaatsahala?» Mbindulili a Rabi: «Mulongisi». <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Nde afutili bo: «Yaani na benu sa limono.» Bo baayeni na nde, na baamoni hu nde hakatsahala. Bo baavyosi muyilala mo wuuna na nde. Aba bebele na ngunga yi mana humbisa a mwangulu.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Andele, muhehe a Simoni Peetelo, aba mumosi mu baboole ba baayuhi mambu ma Yowani na baaduukili Yisu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Nde ayamono tsomi mwaana a ngu a nde Simoni na aleeli nde: «Bisu limiisoolo Masiya!» Masiya mbindulili ni «Kristo». <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Na nde abiti Simoni huli Yisu.Yisu atali nde swii, na aleeli: «We ni Simoni, mwaana a Yowani. Sa bateele we Kefasi.» Kefasi mbindulili ti: «Manya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.42 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Manya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mbindulili ni ti: Peetelo.</char></note>».<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Mu ilumbu hi hyakaduukala, Yisu akani ufutaha hu Ngalili. Nde abwani na Filipo, na aleeli: «Duukala me!» <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filipo aba musi Betesayida, musyenge a Andele na Peetelo. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Titswene Filipo abwani na Natanayeli, na aleeli: «Bisu limiisoolo muutu wu Moose hasonihi mu muhanda Mikele, wu mimbihuli myasiidi nzuhisini mu nde. Ni Yisu, mwaana a Yosefi, musi Nazareti.»<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:18">Pfu 18.18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:5-6">Esa 9.5-6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:23">Ezk 34.23</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanayeli afuuli Filipo: «Hu Nazareti kaka, utwala uyiila dyaambu lilibwe?» Filipo afutili nde: «Yaanga, we sa mono!»<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Bu Yisu hamoni Natanayeli mu uyiila nde, nde aleeli nde: «Me lolo moni musi Isereli wa mbuli a mbuli. Bahala mo linili kaka utwala upfuta!» <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanayeli afuuli nde: «We huni ayaaba me?» Yisu afutili nde: «Tswamina Filipo mu uteele we, me mbeedi amiimono we, ŋa we beedi hu tsina muti a fiinge.» <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Na Natanayeli abweleele nde: «Rabi, we li Mwana a Nzambi, we li Mutumi Isereli<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Mkg 2.7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 3:15">Sof 3.15</ref></char></note>!» <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yisu afutili nde: «Mu tooni a bu me ndeeli we ti me moni we hu tsina muti a fiinge, we miisiila me hiitu? We sa mono mavaanga ma maalutala bunene.» <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Na nde abweleele: «Mu mbuli, mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, benu sa limono mayulu bwasi, na bapofi ba Nzambi mu ukuma, na ukulamana ŋa yulu a nde Mwana a Muutu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:12">Mba 28.12</ref></char></note>!»<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Makwele hu musyenge a Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Bilumbu bitatu bivyoho, hwaba na makweele hu musyenge a Kana, hu itaanzi hya Ngalili. Ngu a Yisu aba ŋaana. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Baatsihi kaka Yisu na bayihi ba nde hu makweele mo maana.<verse eid="JHN 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Bu malamu maafwidi, ngu a Yisu aleeli nde bunuubu: «Bo a basaali na malamu ve.» <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yisu afutili nde: «Mukaasu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mukaasu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">teelili a ngu mu ndaha Ingereke.</char></note>, ki lo ŋa hati la we na me? Tangu a me kini a yaatoodi ve.» <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Ngu a Yisu aleeli huli basalili: «Vaangaani moosi ma nde hutuma benu.»<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Hwaba ŋaana na masanga masamunu ma manene, ma Bayudaayo baakasalila mu tsyemili. We bu hwaba bipfu bya bo. Pasi lisanga laaba na iteesi bebele kama (100) li bikidama. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Bunuubu, Yisu aleeli bo: «Lusaani masanga mo maniima mu mamba.» Na bo baaluusi mo. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Yisu aleeli bo: «Ni tehaani mamba mo maniima, na bitaani mo huli mukuutu mukungi.» Na bo baabitili nde mo. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Bu mukuutu mukungi habiimbi mamba ma maakituhi malamu, nde a hakayaaba huni malamu mo maana maamati ve. Ka basalili ba baatehi mamba aba bayaaba. Nde ateeli mukweli, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />na nde aleeli nde: «Pasi muutu ubamaatehele baatu malamu ma tsohele, titswene ŋa baatu bamiikolo, nde tehili bo malamu ma myenge. Ka we swehi malamu ma mabwe natee bunuubu!»<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Hiina ni iliimbu hya kimuhili hyatsomi hi Yisu hasiidi. Aba hu musyenge a Kana hu Ngalili. Nde amweesi muyusu a nde, na bayihi ba nde baasiidi nde imiinu. <verse eid="JHN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Titswene, nde ayeni hu musyenge a Kapernahumi, na ngu a nde, na baana ba ngu a nde na bayihi ba nde. Na bo baavyosi huuna ndulu mwa bilumbu.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibinga banga mumbungu mu nzo a Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Mukungi a Paake yi Bayudaayo aba aka bebele, na Yisu ayeni hu Yeruselemi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Pal 12.1-27</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Mu litandala la nzo a Nzambi, nde abiisi basuumbisi ba bangombe, baa mandombo na baa mabembe. Nde amoni kaka baatu ba bubaasa sanzi a mbongo, baaba batsahala ŋa busu bwa metse ma bo. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Bu nde havaangi ikooti mu mikudu, nde abingi bo boosi mu litandala la nzo a Nzambi, napa mandombo na bangombe ba bo. Nde atsali mbongo a banga masanzi, nde atakuli metse ma baakasalila, <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />na nde aleeli huli basuumbisi baa mabembe: «Masaani bi byosi ŋa mbuha mo yiniiyi. A likitusa nzo a Taata a me saandu ve!» <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Bayihi ba nde baayibwili moonyi mu mambu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi: «Litondo li me ndi na lo mu tooni a nzo a we o Nzambi, lili mu me we mbaahu yi yili mu ukudasa me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:10">Mkg 69.10</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Bayudaayo baafuuli nde: «Ki iliimbu hya kimuhili we mweesi bisu, mu ubaha muswa wu usa maniima?» <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yisu afutili bo bunuubu: «Tsalaani nzo a ngidi mo yiniiyi. Mu bilumbu bitatu, me umbwetelemese yo.» <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Bayudaayo baakaali nde bunuubu: «Mu utuunga nzo mo yiniiyi, baasiidi maku mana ma bilima, bilima bisamunu. Na we ti mu bilumbu bitatu we ubwetelemese yo?» <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Ka nzo a ngidi yi nde hakaleele, aba ni nyutu a nde mwakulu. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Ni mu buuna, ŋa nde husuuha mu babaakwa, bayihi ba nde bu uyibwala moonyi ti nde aleeli buuna. Na bo bu usa imiinu mu Libuuku la Ngidi, na mu mambu ma Yisu haleeli.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Ŋa Yisu haba hu Yeruselemi, hu mukungi a Paake, baatu ba banzuhisini baasiidi imiinu mu nduhi a nde, mu tooni a bu bo baamoni biliimbu bya kimuhili bi nde hakasa. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Ka Yisu a hakasa hiitu mu bo ve, mu tooni ati nde aba ayaaba bo boosi. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Nde a habeedi na nzala ti muutu ayabisa nde pasi dyaambu li litala muutu ve, mu tooni ati nde aba ayaaba ma mali mu mutima a muutu.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Imoho hya Yisu na Nikodemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Hwaba na bahala limosi, ŋa hati li Bafarisi, nga nduhi a Nikodemo. Nde aba mumosi mu bakuutu ba Bayudaayo. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Nde ayamono Yisu hutso butsuhu na aleeli nde bunuubu: «Rabi, bisu liyaabi ti we ni wu Nzambi hatsindaha mu ulongese bisu. Mu tooni ati, muutu tso mumosi utwala usa biliimbu bya kimuhili bi we li mu usa, tso Nzambi a hali na nde ve.» <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yisu afutili nde bunuubu: «Mu mbuli, mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele we, muutu utwala umono ipfumu hya Nzambi ve, hwavele ubwebuta nde.» <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodemo akaali: «Buni mukuutu bahala mbii me, utwala ubwebutama hu unyatihi? Nde utwala ubwekoto mu moonyi a ngu a nde na ubutama butama la yoole ve.» <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yisu afutili nde bunuubu: «Mu mbuli, mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele we, hwavele ubuta muutu mu mamba na mu Livupu, nde utwala ukoto mu ipfumu hya Nzambi ve. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Hi himiibutama mu musunya hili musunya, na hi himiibutama mu Livupu hili Livupu. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />A hakimuha ve bu me ndeeli we ti: “Hwafwana huli benu mu ubwebutama.” <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Livupu lili we ifula. Lo libanyingasa hu lo litondi. Muutu ubaayuha kele a lo, hwavele uyaaba huni lo lili mu umata, tso huni lo lili mu uyene. Hu li bumosi kaka mu pasi muutu wu miibutama mu Livupu.» <verse eid="JHN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodemo aleeli nde: «Buni buuna buutwala uvangama?» <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yisu afutili nde: «We li Mulongisi wu li mu ulongese Isereli, we a hayaabi mambu mo maana ve! <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Mu mbuli, mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele we, bisu ubaaleele ma bisu layaaba, na bisu ubaata imbangi mu ma bisu laamono, ka benu a lili mu uyaka imbangi hya bisu ve. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Benu a laasiila me imiinu ŋa me toyili benu misamu mya toto ve. Buni benu luusa imiinu ŋa me utoyele benu misamu mi mayulu? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />A hu li na muutu wu avaata hu yulu ve, vengo Mwana a muutu, wu akulamana umata hu mayulu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 30:4">Mak 30.4</ref></char></note>! <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Hu kumu, Moose abandihi na asyenuli taadi ŋa yulu muti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aba taadi wu baavangi na baabandihi ŋa muti </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 21:9">Mat 21.9</ref></char>.</note>. Ni bumosi kaka, Mwana a Muutu bafwana ubaandiha, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />mana boosi ba bali mu usiila nde imiinu, babaha moonyi wu bilima na bilima. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Ka mbi bu Nzambi hatondi tsi, nde atsindihi Mwana a nde wu livingu, mana pasi nde wu usiila nde imiinu, avele bungana, ka nde sa abaha moonyi wu bilima na bilima. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Nzambi a hatsindihi Mwana a nde mu utsundasa baatu ve, ka mu tooni ati baatu bayoboho mu nde. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Woosi wu li mu usiila nde imiinu amiipala mu tsundusu. Ka woosi wu avelesiila nde imiinu, amiikoto mu tsundusu, mu tooni ati nde a hasa imiinu mu nduhi a Mwana a Nzambi wu livingu ve.<verse eid="JHN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Mono buni tsundusu yuvangama: liyalala laayidi mu tsi, ka baatu baatondi hwa bo piipidi na baatiimbi liyalala, mu tooni ati mavaanga ma bo mali ma mabi. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Pasi muutu wu ubaavanga ma mabi abelele liyalala, na nde ubaatahuha na lo. Nde ubaasa buuna, mana mavaanga ma nde ma mabi a mayabana. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Ka nde wuuna wu ubaasalila imbuli, nde li mu uya hu liyalala, mana bayaaba ti mavaanga ma nde mali ma litondo la Nzambi.»<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imbangi hya tsyelele hya Yowani Mutondihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Humbisa a maana, Yisu ayeni na bayihi ba nde hu itaanzi hya Yude. Huuna, nde avyosi na bo mwa bilumbu, na nde akatondehe baatu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Yowani kaka akatondehe hu bula bwa Enoni, hu pedu a bula bwa Salimi, mu tooni ati huuna hwaba na mamba ma malahi. Na baatu baakaya huli Yowani mu uyaka tondihili. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Mu taangu mo yiina, Yowani aba kini a hakoti kondayi ve.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Ka bayihi ba Yowani bakima, baabaandihi imoho na Muyudaayo mumosi mu tooni bipfu bya tsyemili a nyutu. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Bo baayamono Yowani na baaleeli nde bunuubu: «Rabi, we li mu uyibwala moonyi mu muutu wu aba na we hu simu lina la Yolodani, wu we atiili imbangi? Ka bunuubu nde aka mu utondehe, na baatu boosi bali mu uyene huli nde!»<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yowani afutili bo: «Muutu utwala usa pasi isiha ve, tso Nzambi a haviidi nde muswa ve. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Benu mwakulu lili mu uta imbangi ti me andeeli: “Me, me a handi Kristo ve, ka baatsindihi me ŋa busu bwa nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3.1</ref> </char></note>.” <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Wu abaha mukadi na? Ni mulumi a nde! Ka mu mukungi makweele, mbaahi mulumi ni wu ubaatsahala ŋa pedu mulumi, na ubaayuhala nde. Nde ubaamono kinya yindahi mu uyuha ndaha mulumi. Kinya mo yiina ni ya me, na yo yili yi yaakuha. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Nde Kristo afwana usyenoho, na me apfwana ukulamana.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Muutu wuuna wu amata hu yulu, afulala baatu boosi tsongo. Ka muutu wu li wa toto, li wa toto, na nde ubaatoyo mu bya toto. Buuna, muutu wu li mu umata hu yulu, [nde afulala baatu boosi tsongo]. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Nde ubaata imbangi mu ma nde hamono na hayuha, ka muutu tso mumosi a hali mu usiinga imbangi hya nde ve. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Muutu wu li mu usiinga imbangi hya nde, li mu usilasa ti Nzambi li imbuli. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Muutu wu Nzambi hatsindaha, ubaaleele mambu ma Nzambi. Mu tooni ati, Nzambi ubaava nde Livupu mu iteesi hi hyafulala. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Taata ubaatondo Mwana, na amiiva bisiha byosi ŋa myoho mya nde. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Muutu wu ubaasiila Mwana a Nzambi imiinu, li na moonyi wu bilima na bilima. Ka wu uveleyuhala Mwana a Nzambi, a hubaha moonyi mo ve. Na kesi a Nzambi sa yiba ŋa yulu a nde.»<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu na mukaasu wa Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Yisu ayaabi ti Bafarisi baayuhi ti nde akabaha, na utondehe bayihi ufulala Yowani. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Imbuli ni ti, Yisu nde mwakulu a hakatondehe baatu ve. Ka ni bayihi ba nde baakatondehe. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Titswene, nde asiisi tsi a Yude na afutihi hu Ngalili. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Mu uyene hu tsi Ngalili, hwafwani huli nde mu ukese mu tsi a Samariya. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Nde atoodi ŋa bula bumosi bu bwaba bebele na tsi a Samariya, bwa nduhi a Sikari. Bula mo buuna bwaba ŋa pedu a tsyehe yi Yakobi haviidi huli mwaana a nde Yosefi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 33:19">Mba 33.19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Yos 24.32</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Huuna, hwaba na iyuna hya mamba hya Yakobi. Bu Yisu haba hamiikolo mu tooni mudyenge, nde ayatsahala ŋa muvanga a iyuna mo. Aba bebele na mwangulu.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Mu tangu mo yiina, mukaasu mumosi wa Samariya ayidi mu utehe mamba. Yisu ni uleele nde: «Va me mamba ma unywa.» <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Bayihi ba nde aba baamiiyene hu musyenge mu uyasuumba byudya. <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Mukaasu wa Samariya ni uleele nde: «Buni we wu li Muyudaayo, we uvondo mamba ma unywa huli me, me wu li musi Samariya?» Nde haleeli buuna, mu tooni ati Bayudaayo a bubaayuhasana na bisu Samariya ve. <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yisu ni ufutala nde: «Kini we ayaaba bungodu bwa Nzambi, na tso we kiyaaba na li mu uleele we: “Va me mamba ma unywa”, kini we ni wu kiivondo mamba ma unywa, na nde kiiva we mamba ma moonyi.» <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Mukaasu ni ukaala: «Pfumu, we ti a hali na itehili ve, titswene iyuna hyadongo. Hwavele itehili, we mamba mo ma moonyi ka buni kiibaha? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />We akulala kaaha a bisu Yakobi, wu aviidi bisu iyuna mo hinihi? Ni iyuna hi Yakobi hanywidi mamba nde mwakulu na baana ba nde, na biboodi bya nde.» <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yisu afutili nde: «Pasi nde wuuna wu unywa mamba mo maniima, sa abwebaha peyu. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Ka muutu wu unywa mamba ma me upa nde, a hubwebaha peyu ve. Mamba ma me upa nde, sa makituha mutswe a nzali mu nde. Ni mutswe a nzali wu ukaapalisa mamba na mifudi, te mu moonyi wu bilima na bilima<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 12:3">Esa 12.3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:13">Yel 2.13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:13">17.13</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Mukaasu ni uleele nde: «Pfumu, va me mamba mo maana, mana me pelembwembaha peyu a mamba, na me pelembwenzatehe mamba ŋa.»<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yisu ti: «Yene, yateele mulumi a we na we yaafutaha ŋa.» <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Mukaasu ni ufutala nde: «Me a handi na mulumi ve.» Yisu ti: «Ni mbuli, bu we miileele ti me a handi na mulumi ve. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Mu tooni ati, we abahi balumi bataanu, na wu we li na nde loloyi, a hali mulumi a we ve. Hiina ni imbuli we miileele.» <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Mukaasu mo afutili: «Pfumu, me ndi mu umono ti we mumbihuli a Nzambi we li. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Bakaaha ba bisu baakuundi ŋa yulu isyelo mo hinihi, ka benu Bayudaayo libaasitasa ti mbuha yi baafwana ukuunda, ni hu Yeruselemi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 122:1-4">Mkg 122.1-4</ref> </char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yisu aleeli nde: «Maama, siila me imiinu, taangu sa yito, yi benu lukaakunda Taata Nzambi pasi mbuha, tso hu Yeruselemi, tso ŋa yulu isyelo mo hinihi. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Benu bisu Samariya, benu a liyaabi na benu lili mu ukuunda ve. Ka bisu Bayudaayo, bisu liyaabi na bisu lili mu ukuunda. Mu tooni ati, liyobolo ubaamata huli Bayudaayo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:3">Esa 2.3</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Ka taangu sa yito, na yo yaamiito, yi bakuundi baa mbuli buukakuunda Taata mu mutima woosi na mu imbuli hyoosi. Mu tooni ati, ni bakuundi baa pila yiina Taata ali mu usaha. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Nzambi ni Livupu, hufwani ti boosi ba buukuunda nde, babaakuunda nde mu mutima na mu imbuli.»<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Mukaasu ni uleele nde: «Me nzaabi ti Masiya wu bali mu uteele Kristo, mu uya ali. Ŋa nde huya, nde sa ayabisa bisu mambu moosi.» <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yisu aleeli nde: «Me ni nde wuuna, me wu ndi mu utoyo na we.»<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Ŋa mbisa, bayihi ba nde baayafutaha. Bo baakimuhi bu nde hakatoyo na mukaasu mumosi. Ka tso mumosi mu bo a hafuuli nde ve ti: «We na nde hima?» Buuve: « Mu hima we li mu utoyo na nde?» <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Na bu mukaasu hasiisi lisanga la nde, nde ayeni hu musyenge na ayayabisa huli baatu: <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />«Yamonwaani bahala li limiiyabisa me moosi ma me apaanga. Peleve nde ni Kristo hwande!» <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Bo baapali hutso musyenge na baayabwana Yisu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Mu taangu mo yiina, bayihi baakaleele nde: «Rabi, we afwana udya!» <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Ka nde afutili bo: «Me na byudya bi benu laaveleyaaba.» <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Bayihi baakalelesene: «Aa! Kaahu na muutu wu behili nde byudya?» <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yisu afutili bo: «Bya me byudya ni mu ukuhasa litondo la Taata wu atsindaha me, na umana isalu hi nde hava me.»<verse eid="JHN 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />«Benu a lili mu uleele ve ti: “Batsungi bamiisaala bana, na sa bakukaha muhunu”? Ka me, me ndeele benu: syenolwaani miisu, na kengesaani matsyehe bubwe. Mbutu yimiyele na taangu yimiito yi ukoolo yo! <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Wu li mu ukuukaha muhunu ubaabaha pfuta a nde, na nde ubaakoolo mbutu, ni baatu ba buubaha moonyi wu bilima na bilima. Buuna, wu li mu ukuna na wu li mu ukuukaha, bali mu kinya bo baboole. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Ni mu tooni mo yiina, mbuli kuma yili mu uleele: “Mumosi ubaakuna, na mukima ubaakukaha.” <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Me atsindaha benu mu uyakuukaha hutso a tsyehe yi benu laavelesala. Ni tsyehe yi bakima baasala, ka benu laabaha kaluha mu isalu hya bo.»<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Bisu Samariya ba banzuhisini baa bula mo buuna, baasiidi imiinu mu Yisu mu tooni imbangi hi mukaasu hatiidi: «Nde miiyabisa me moosi ma me apaanga.» <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Ni mu buuna, bisu Samariya baayidi huli nde, bo baayayiini nde mu utsahala na bo. Na nde atsahili huuna bilumbu byole. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Litangu la baatu ba baasiidi imiinu mu mikuma mi Yisu hakaleele, laafulili bunzuhisini. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Na bo baakaleele huli mukaasu: «A hisaali ndulu mu tooni imbangi hya we bisu limiisa imiinu ve. Ka bisu mwakulu limiiyuha nde, na bisu limiiyaaba ti mbuli, nde ni Muyobili a tsi.»<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso mwaana a mukuutu hu Ngalili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Humbisa bilumbu mo byole biina, Yisu apali mu bula mo buuna, mu uyene hu Ngalili. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Ni mbuli, nde aleeli mu nde mwakulu ti: «Mumbihuli a hubaayaka likiinzu mu tsi a nde mwakulu ve.» <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Ka ŋa nde hatoodi hu Ngalili, bisu Ngalili baayaki nde bubwe, mu tooni ati bo kaka baayeni hu mukungi a Paake, hu Yeruselemi. Bo baamoni moosi ma nde havangi hu mukungi mo wuuna. <verse eid="JHN 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Nde afutihi hu musyenge a Kana hu itaanzi hya Ngalili, hu nde hakitusi mamba mu malamu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:46">Hwaba hu Kapernahumi, mukuutu masadaadu, wu akasala na pfumu, wu mwaana a nde haba na ubeele. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Mukuutu masadaadu ayuhi ti Yisu miimata hu itaanzi hya Yude, mu uyene hu Ngalili. Nde ayamono nde na ayayini, mu uyabeeloso mwaana a nde wu aba aka ŋa pedu lipfu, hu Kapernahumi. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yisu aleeli nde: « Tangu yoosi, benu ubaasaha umamono biliimbu bya kimuhili na bipadi, mu usiila me imiinu.» <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Mukuutu masadaadu aleeli nde: «Pfumu, yanga mawasa huli me, teehele mwaana a me akwa.» <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yisu afutili: «Yene, mwaana a we uba moonyi.» Na bahala mo laasiidi imiinu mu ma Yisu haleeli nde, na lo ayeni. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Bu nde haba mu ufutaha, basalili ba nde baayabwana nde mu nzila na baayabisi nde: «Mwana a we moonyi a li.» <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Nde afuuli bo mu ki ngunga mwaana a nde amoni nyutu bubwe. Na bo baaleeli nde: «Matsiha, mu ngunga yatsomi ya humbisa a mwangulu, baahu laamata mu nde.» <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Taata ayibwili ti, ni mu ngunga mo yiina Yisu haleeli nde: «Mwana a we uba moonyi.» Mu taangu mo yiina, nde asiidi imiinu mu Yisu, nde na nzo a nde yoosi. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Hiina aba ni iliimbu hya byole hi Yisu hasiidi hu Ngalili. Nde hasiidi hyo, ŋa nde hamati hu itaanzi hya Yude.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso ikata hu idiinga hya Betsata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Titswene, aba na mukungi mumosi wu Bayudaayo, na Yisu akumi hu Yeruselemi. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Ŋa pedu ikotili hi musyenge, ikotili hi «Mandombo», hwaba na idiinga imosi hi bubaateele mu ndaha Bayudaayo: «Betsata». Hwaba na mapombo mataanu mamanene, ma maaba maadinga idiinga. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Hu tsina mapombo mo maana, hwaba hwalambama koonge babeedu: binzimana, banga matsode, na ba baavolo binama. [Bo baakakeele ti mamba manyingama, <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />mu tooni ati, pofi a Pfumu akakulamana matangu makima na akanyingasa mamba ma idiinga. Watsomi mu babeedu mu usutaha mu mamba ma bamiinyingasa, akabeeloho, mu pasi bubeedu.]<verse eid="JHN 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Hwaba ŋaana, na bahala limosi li laakabeele, umata bilima maku matatu na pwombo (38). <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yisu amoni nde alaambama na ayaabi ti nde aba mu iteesi mo hiina umata beleve. Yisu aleeli nde: «We tondi ubeeloho?» <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Mubeedu ni ufutala nde: «Pfumu, me a handi na muutu wu ubwadiha me mu idiinga ŋa mamba mali mu unyingama ve. Mu taangu yi me tondi uyene huuna, mukima amiiteehele me.» <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yisu aleeli nde: «Teleme, volo ikala hya we, na yene.» <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Mawasa-mawasa, bahala mo linili laabeeluhi, lo laavoli ikala hya lo na laayeni. Maana maakavangama mu ilumbu hya saba.<verse eid="JHN 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Bayudaayo ni uleele huli bahala li laabeeluhi: «Loloyi ti ilumbu hya saba, we a hali na muswa mu ubita ikala hya we ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:21">Yel 17.21</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Nde afutili bo: « Muutu wu beelusi me leeli me: “Volo ikala hya we na yene.”» <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Bo ni ufuula nde: «Na wuuna leeli we: “Volo ikala hya we na yene”?» <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Ka bahala li Yisu habeelusi a laakayaaba wu abeelusi nde ve. Mu tooni ati, Yisu avyasuhi ŋatso a konge a baatu ba baaba ŋaana.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Humbisa, Yisu amoni bahala mo li nde habeelusi, mu litandala la nzo a Nzambi. Na aleeli lo buunuubu: «Mono! We miibeeloho. A habwesa masumu, mana dyambu li laafulala bunono a libwila we.» <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Bahala mo laayayabisa huli Bayudaayo ti muutu wu abeelusi nde aba Yisu. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Bayudaayo baakabingasa Yisu, mu tooni ati nde hakasa mavaanga mo maana mu ilumbu hya saba. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Ka Yisu afutili bo: «Taata a me li mu usala taangu yoosi, na me kaka ndi mu utsala.» <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Bu Bayudaayo baayuhi buuna, piinga a bo yi uduba Yisu yaafulili. Bo baakasaha uduba nde, ndulu a bu nde hakavelekiinza ilumbu hya saba ve, ka fula-fula, bu nde hakateele Nzambi Taata a nde na ubaamonehele we itsiitsa hya nde.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lituma li Taata hava Mwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yisu ni ufutala huli Bayudaayo: «Mu mbuli, mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, Mwana utwala usa pasi isiha mu nde mwakulu ve. Ka Mwana ubaasa ndulu bi nde ubaamono Taata mu usa. Na byosi bi Taata ubaasa, Mwana kaka ubaakuhasa byo usa. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Bu Taata hatondo Mwana, nde ubaamweese Mwana byosi bi nde ubaasa. Na nde umweese nde mavaanga ma maalutala bunene na ma benu laateehili umono, mana benu likimuha. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />We bu Taata ubaasuula babaakwa na ubaava bo moonyi, ni bumosi kaka Mwana ubaava moonyi huli muutu wu nde atondi. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Taata a hali mu utsundasa pasi muutu ve, ka nde ava lituma li utsundasa huli Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />Nde hasa buuna, mana boosi babaakiinza Mwana, we bu bo bali mu ukiinza Taata wu atsindaha nde. Mu tooni ati, muutu wu avelekiinza Mwana, a hali mu ukiinza Taata ve.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />Mu mbuli, mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, muutu wu li mu uyuha mambu ma me, na li mu usa imiinu mu wuuna wu atsindaha me, nde li na moonyi wu bilima na bilima. Nde a hukoto mu tsundusu ve, ka nde amiimata mu lipfu na uvyoho hu moonyi. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Mu mbuli mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, ngunga yili mu uya, na yaamiito, yi babaakwa buyuha ndaha a Mwana a Nzambi. Ba buyuha yo, sa baba moonyi. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />We bu Taata ali na moonyi mu nde mwakulu, ni bumosi kaka nde hava Mwana muswa mu ubaha moonyi mu nde mwakulu. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Bu nde ali Mwana a Muutu, Taata aviidi nde lituma li utsundasa baatu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />A likimuha mu tooni a maana ve. Ngunga yili mu uya, yi boosi ba bali mu mangila buuyuha ndaha a nde, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />na sa bapala mu mangila ma bo. Boosi ba baasiidi ma mabwe sa basuuha mu ubaha moonyi. Ka boosi ba baasiidi ma mabi sa basuuha mu uyaka tsundusu a bo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12.2</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Me utwala usa pasi isiha mu me mwakulu ve. Me ubaatsundasa we bu Taata ubaatuma me, na tsundusu a me yili ya tsiitsa. Mu tooni ati, me a handi mu utsaha usa litondo la me mwakulu ve, ka mu ukuhasa litondo la Taata wu atsindaha me.»<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Taata li mu utiila Yisu imbangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />«Tso me ndi mbangi a me mwakulu, imbangi hya me a hili hi hyasungama ve. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Ka, hu li na muutu mukima wu ubaatiila me imbangi, na me nzaabi ti imbangi hi nde ubaatiila me, hili hi hyasungama. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Benu bakuutu ba Bayudaayo, benu laatsindihi bayihi ba benu huli Yowani, na nde atiidi imbangi mu imbuli hya me. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Me a handi na nzala ati batiila me imbangi ve. Ka me ndi mu undeele maana, mana benu liyoboho. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yowani aba we mwinda wu bali mu ubaangisa, mana nde ayalusa baatu boosi. Mu mwaana taangu hoole, benu laamoni kinya mu liyalala la nde.<verse eid="JHN 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Ka me ndi na imbangi hi hyafulala hya Yowani bunene. Mu tooni ati, mavaanga ma Taata hava me mu ukuhasa, ni mavaanga mo maana me ndi mu utsa. Mo mali mu utiila me imbangi ti Taata ni wu atsindaha me. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Na Taata wu atsindaha me, li mu utiila me kaka imbangi. Ka benu kini a laayuhi ndaha a nde ve, tso umono hiinzi hya nde. <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />Na mukuma a nde a hali mu ukwilala mu benu ve. Mu tooni ati, benu a lili mu usa imiinu mu wuuna wu nde hatsindaha ve.<verse eid="JHN 5:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Bu benu libaatsima ubaha moonyi wu bilima na bilima, benu lili mu ukengese bubwe-buwe Mabuuku ma Ngidi. Ka mo ni ma mali mu utiila me imbangi. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Benu ti a lili mu utondo uya huli me mu uyaka moonyi wa mbuli ve!<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />Me a handi mu utsaha ubaha muyusu wu ubaamata huli baatu ve. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Ka me nzaabi benu: Benu a lili na litondo mu Nzambi mu mitima mya benu ve. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Me anza mu nduhi a Taata a me, na benu a laayaka me ve. Ka tso mukima yidi mu nduhi a nde mwakulu, benu sa liyaka nde. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Buni benu luutwala usa imiinu mu me? Benu baa libaayusasana, na baa lavelesaha muyusu wu ubaamata huli Nzambi siha. <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />A litsima ve ti me tsa kese benu huli Taata. Wu li mu ukese<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.45<char style="xt">Pfu 31.26-27</char></char></note> benu Moose, wu benu laasuusala hiitu hya benu. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Tso benu libasiila Moose imiinu, benu likiisiila me kaka imiinu, bu nde hasonehe mu tooni a me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Pfu 18.15</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Ka benu livelesa imiinu mu maambu ma nde hasonehe, buni benu luutwala usa imiinu mu mambu ma me?»<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibuungala konge a baatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Titswene, Yisu ayeni hu simu lina la dyanga la Ngalili, li babaateele kaka dyanga la Tiberiyade. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Konge a baatu yinene yaakaduukala nde, mu tooni ati yo yaakamono biliimbu bya kimuhili bi nde hakasa mu ubeeloso babeedu. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Yisu avaati isyelo, na nde atsahili ŋaana na bayihi ba nde. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Mukungi a Paake wu Bayudaayo aba aka bebele.<verse eid="JHN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yisu asiimbula miisu, ni umono konge a baatu yinene yi yaakaya huli nde. Yisu ni uleele Filipo: «Huni bisu a benu lusuumbani mapa, mana baatu mo baniiba boosi babaha byudya?» <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Nde haleeli buuna mu ukete imiinu hya Filipo, mu tooni ati Yisu aba amiikwayaaba ma nde husa. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filipo ni ufutala nde: «Tso likiisalila makama moole (200) ma denye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">makama moole (200) ma denye </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mbongo a pfuta a muutu mu batsungi basamunu.</char></note> mu usuumba mapa, a makiikuha mu ukabila huli pasi muutu tso mwa itini ve.» <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Mukima mu bayihi ba nde, nga nduhi a Andele, mwaana a ngu a Simoni Peetelo, ni uleele Yisu bunuubu: <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />«Ŋaniiŋa hu li na mufudu mbahala wu li na mapa mataanu na batswi boole. Ka mwa bisiha mo biina utwala ubuungala musiiku a baatu mobaniba ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:42-44">2Pf 4.42-44</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yisu ni uleele: «Tsahisaani bo.» Bu hwaba na biimbu bi bilahi ŋa mbuha mo yiina, baatu baatsahili mu toto. Litangu la baatu aba laato bebele na biveeve bitaanu (5 000) bi babahala. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yisu avoli mapa, afutili matondo huli Nzambi, na akabi mo huli ba baaba ŋaana. Nde aviidi bo kaka batswi mu iteesi hi bo baatondi. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Bu bo baaywati, nde aleeli huli bayihi ba nde: «Tolwaani bitsudu bi bimiisaala, mana pasi isiha a hibungana.» <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Bo baatoli byo, na baaluusi maponzi kuumi na moole, ma bitsudu bi mapa bi byasalili mu mapa mataanu ma baatu baadiidi.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Bu baatu baamoni iliimbu hya kimuhili hi Yisu hasiidi, bo baakaleele: «Mbuli nde ni Mumbihuli wu akiifwana uya mu tsi!» <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yisu ayaabi ti baatu baakiyavolo nde mu mifudi na ubyalisa nde mutumi. Nde abwevyasuha na ayeni nde siha hu yulu isyelo.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu uyene ŋa yulu a mamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Tsitsaha bu yaatoodi, bayihi ba Yisu baakulimini natee ŋa muvanga a dyanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Bo baanami ŋa yulu a luungu mu uyene hu Kapernahumi, hu simu lina la dyanga. Aba hutso butsuhu, na Yisu aba kini a habiisili bo ve. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Ifula hi mifudi hyakanyingasa mamba ma dyanga.<verse eid="JHN 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Bayihi baakayene mu luungu na bu bo baatoodi lala, bo baatalili Yisu mu uyene mu miilu ŋa yulu a mamba, na uyaasusaha hu pedu a luungu. Bayihi baamoni boomo na baatsuli likamba. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Ka Yisu aleeli bo: «Wunuwu me, a liba na boomo ve!» <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Bo baakiisaha ukotese nde mu luungu, ka mu mawasa, luungu laatoodi simu lina, hutsyelo yi bo baaba mudwe.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu ni lipa la moonyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Ilumbu hi hyaduukili, konge a baatu yi yaasaali hu simu lina la dyanga, yaamoni ti aba ŋaana ndulu luungu limosi. Baatu baayaabi ti Yisu a hakoti mu luungu mo liina na bayihi ba nde ve. Ka bo siha baayeni. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Bunuubu, maluungu makima ma maamati hu Tiberiyade, maayato bebele na mbuha yi bo baadiidi mapa, humbisa hu Pfumu Yisu afutili matondo huli Nzambi. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Bu konge a baatu yaamoni ti tso Yisu, tso bayihi ba nde, a baabedi ŋaana ve, bo baakoti bo mwakulu mutso maluungu mo maana, na baayeni hu Kapernahumi mu uyasaha Yisu. <verse eid="JHN 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Bo baasooli nde hu simu lina la dyanga na baaleeli nde: «Rabi, ki taangu we amiiyato huni?» <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yisu ni ufutala bo: «Mu mbuli mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, benu lili mu usaha me, a bu benu limiimono biliimbu bya kimuhili ve. Ka mu tooni ati benu limiidya mapa na limiiywata. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />A lisala mu tooni a byudya bi bibaabungana ve. Ka saalaani mu tooni a byudya bi bibaava baatu moonyi wu bilima na bilima. Ni byudya bi Mwana a Muutu huva benu, mu tooni ati Taata Nzambi amiikuma nde iliimbu, mu umweese ti nde amiisilasa lituma la nde.»<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Bo ni ufuula nde: «Hima bisu lafwana usa mu ukuhasa mavaanga ma Nzambi atondi?» <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yisu afutili bo: «Mavaanga ma Nzambi ali mu utondo ti benu likuhasa, ni mu usa imiinu mu wuuna wu nde hatsindaha.» <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Bo ni uleele nde: «Ki iliimbu hya kimuhili we umweese bisu, mana bisu lisiila we imiinu? Ki vanga we umweese? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Bakaaha ba bisu baadiidi maane mu kumu we bu baasonehe: “Nde aliisili bo mu mapa ma maamati hu yulu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:4">Pal 16.4</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 16:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Mkg 78.24</ref> </char></note>.”» <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yisu aleeli bo: «Mu mbuli, mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, a Moose aviidi benu mapa ma maamati hu yulu ve. Ka ni Taata a me ubaava benu mapa ma mbuli ma yulu. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Mu tooni ati lipa la Nzambi ni li libaakulamana umata hu yulu, na li libaava baatu ba tsi moonyi.» <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Bo baaleeli nde: «Pfumu, baava bisu lipa mo liina taangu yoosi.»<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yisu ni uleele: «Me, me ndi lipa la moonyi. Pasi muutu wu uya huli me, a hukaakwa nzala ve. Na wu usiila me imiinu, a hukaamono peyu ve. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Me andeele benu ti, benu limiimono me, ka tso bu benu limiimono me, benu a lili mu usa imiinu ve. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Boosi ba Taata huva me, sa baya huli me. Na pasi nde wu uya huli me, me a unyasula nde ve. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Mu tooni ati, tso me akulamana umata hu yulu, a mu uvanga litondo la me ve, ka mu kuhasa litondo la wu atsindaha me. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Na litondo la wu atsindaha me ni liniili: ti me pelenyambasana tso muutu mumosi mu boosi ba nde haviidi me, ka ni ti me tsuula bo ŋa hati la babaakwa mu ilumbu hya tsyelele. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Eye, litondo la Taata a me ni liniili: woosi wu umono Mwana a nde, na usiila nde imiinu, ubaha moonyi wu bilima na bilima. Na me utsuula nde mu ilumbu hya tsyelele.»<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Bayudaayo baakaŋono mu nde, mu tooni a bu nde haleeli ti: «Me ni lipa li laakulamana umata hu yulu.» <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Bo baakaleele: «Wunuuwu a ni Yisu mwaana a Yosefi ve? Bisu laayaaba bubwe-bubwe taata na ngu a nde. Ka buni nde ali mu uleele ti: “Me akulamana umata hu yulu”?» <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yisu afutili bo: «Nyahaani uŋono. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Muutu tso mumosi utwala uya huli me ve, tso Taata wu atsindaha me a habehi nde ve. Me tsa tsuula muutu mo wuuna ŋa hati la babaakwa, mu ilumbu hya tsyelele. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Mimbihuli myasonehe bunuubu: “Nzambi sa alongese baatu boosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Esa 54.13</ref></char></note>.” Pasi nde wu uyuhala Taata na uyaka ndongisili a nde, li mu uya huli me. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Buuna a hu li mu umweese ve ti, hu li na muutu wu amono Taata. Ka ndulu nde wuuna wu amata huli Nzambi, amono Taata. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Mu mbuli, mu mbuli, me ndeele benu lo, wuuna wu usiila nde imiinu, miibaha moonyi wu bilima na bilima. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Me, me ndi lipa la moonyi. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Bakaaha baa benu baadiidi maane mu kumu, ka bo baakwidi. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Ka liniili ni lipa li lili mu ukulamana umata hu yulu. Pasi muutu wu udya lo, a hukwa ve. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Me, me ndi lipa la moonyi li laakulamana umata hu yulu. Tso muutu diidi lipa mo liina, nde sa abaha moonyi wu bilima na bilima. Lipa li me upa, ni musunya a me. Me ndi mu upa nde, mana baatu ba tsi babaha moonyi.»<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Bayudaayo baakatsotsosono na mifudi na ubaaleele: «Buni muutu mo wunuuwu hutwala uva bisu musunya a nde mu udya?» <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yisu ni uleele bo: «Mu mbuli mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, tso benu a lidiidi musunya a Mwana a Muutu ve, na tso benu a linywidi makila ma nde ve, benu a luubaha moonyi ve. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Pasi muutu wu udya musunya a me na unywa makila ma me, li na moonyi. Na me tsa tsuula nde mu ilumbu hya tsyelele. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Mu tooni ati, musunya a me li byudya bi bibaaywatisa, na makila ma me mali byunywa bi bibaamana peyu. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Pasi muutu wu udya musunya a me na unywa makila ma me, li mu ukwilala itwadi na me, na me ukwilala mu nde. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />We bu Taata wu atsindaha me ali moonyi, me ndi moonyi mu tooni a Taata. Bumosi kaka, muutu wu udya musunya a me sa aba moonyi mu tooni a me. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Liniili ni lipa li laakulamana umata hu yulu. Lo a lili we ma bakaaha ba benu baadiidi ve. Mu tooni ati, humbisa udya mapa mo maana, bo baakwidi. Ka muutu wu udya lipa mo liniili, sa aba moonyi nzyeni.» <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yisu haleeli mambu mo maana, ŋa nde hakalongese mu nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo hu Kapernahumi.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bayihi bamiitimba Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Ba banzuhisini mu bayihi ba nde bu baamani uyuha nde, baaleeli: «Dyambu mo liniili lilutiili bunono. Muutu utwala usiinga lo ve.» <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Bu Yisu hayaabi ti bayihi ba nde baakaŋono mu tooni a dyaambu mo liina, nde afuuli bo: «Dyambu mo liniili limiikwamisa benu? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Ka buni buuba, tso benu limoni Mwana a Muutu mu ubwekuma hu nde haba tsomi? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Ni Livupu la Nzambi libaava moonyi. Musunya a hali na tsongo ve. Mambu ma me ndeeli benu mali mu umata mu Livupu, na mali ma uva moonyi huli baatu. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Ka ŋa hati la benu, hu li na ba baavelesa imiinu.» Mu mbuli, Yisu aba ayaaba umata hu mbandu, baana ba baavelesa imiinu mu nde, na wu akiyeholo nde. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Na nde abweleele: «Ni mu buuna me ndi mu undeele benu, muutu utwala uya huli me ve, tso Taata a haviidi nde muswa ve.»<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Umata taangu mo yiina, bayihi ba nde ba banzuhisini baatiimbi nde, na a baakabweyene na nde ve. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Ni mu buuna, Yisu haleeli huli kuumi na bayihi boole ba nde: «Benu kaka a litondi uyene ve?» <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoni Peetelo ni ufutala nde: «Pfumu, bisu ka huli na luuyene? We ni nga mambu ma mu baava moonyi wu bilima na bilima. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Bisu lili mu usa imiinu, na bisu liyaabi ti we ni Kristo, wa Ngidi wu Nzambi hatsindaha!» <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yisu afutili bo bunuubu: «Me, me ni wu asoolo benu, kuumi na boole. Ka mumosi mu benu muutu wu Mukuyi ali!» <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Nde hakaleele buuna mu tooni a Yuda, mwaana a Simoni Isikariyoti. Mu tooni ati, nde ni wu aba amiikuta usumbasa Yisu. Nde wu aba hwande mumosi mu kuumi na bayihi boole baa Yisu.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Baana baa ngu a Yisu a bali mu usa nde imiinu ve</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Humbisa a maana, Yisu akataangili itaanzi hya Ngalili. Ka nde a hakatondo udyenge mu itaanzi hya Yude ve. Mu tooni ati, lituma li Bayudaayo, laakasaha uduba nde. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Ka mukungi Bayudaayo wu bitudu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mukungi bitudu aba mukungi wu akadinga limiingu li litindala. Nde akakwelene na mukungi wu baakakukaha. Mu mukungi mo wuuna, baatu baakayibwala moonyi mu taangu yi Isereli hyaba mu kumu. Baatu baakabwamina mu bitudu natee bu mukungi mo wuuna hakafwa. Bayudaayo boosi baakaya hu Yeruselemi mu usambila. <char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 23:34-36">Lev 23.34-36</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13">Pfu 16.13</ref></char>.</char></note> aba aka bebele. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Na baana ba ngu a Yisu baaleeli nde: «Mata ŋaniiŋa, na yene hu tsi a Yude, mana bayihi ba we kaka bamono mavaanga ma we li mu usa. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />A hu li na muutu wu ubaasa mavaanga mu tswehi ve, tso nde tondi uyabahana. Bu we li mu usa mavaanga ma manene, nyaha we yabahana huli baatu boosi.» <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Ka baana ba ngu a nde bo mwakulu, a baakasa imiinu mu nde ve.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yisu aleeli bo: «Tangu a me a yamato kini ve, ka uto ti mu benu, pasi taangu yili yimbwe. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Baatu ba tsi utwala ubelele benu ve. Ka bo baabelele me. Mu tooni ati, me umbaata imbangi ti mavaanga ma bo mali ma mabi. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Benu, yenaani hwa benu hu mukungi. Me a unzyene hu mukungi mo wuuna ve, mu tooni ati, ya me taangu kini a yatoodi ve.» <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Bu nde hamani uleele bo maana, nde asaali hwa nde hu Ngalili.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miiyene hu mukungi bitudu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Ka bu baana ba ngu a nde baayeni hu mukungi, nde kaka ayeni huuna hwavele uyabisa baatu, na uvelemonehele ŋa kungi la baatu. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Mu taangu mukungi mo wuuna, batumi baa Bayudaayo baakasaha nde na baakafuula: «Nde huni ali?» <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Na mutso makonge ma baatu, hwaba na wadi-wadi mu nduhi a nde. Bamosi baakaleele: «Nde muutu nga mavaanga ma mabwe.» Bakima ti: «Naana! Nde baatu ubaasoho.» <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Ka muutu tso mumosi a hakatoyo mu nde paayalala ve, mu tooni a boomo bu Bayudaayo.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu ulongese mu nzo a Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Mukungi aba aka hahati, Yisu ayeni hu nzo a Nzambi na nde abandihi ulongese. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Bayudaayo baakimuhi na baakalelesene: «Nde buni hayaaba mambu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi maniima, nde wu aveleyiha muhanda?» <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yisu afutili bo: «Ndongisili yi me ndi mu upa, a yili yi me ambaha ve. Ka yo yili ya Nzambi wu atsindaha me. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Tso muutu tondi ukuhasa litondo la Nzambi, nde utsikaha tso ndongisili a me yili mu umata huli Nzambi, buuve ti yo yili mu umata mu matsimi ma me mwakulu. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Muutu wu ubaatoyo mu nde mwakulu, ubaasaha ndulu muyusu a nde. Ka pasi nde wu ubaasaha muyusu a nde wuuna wu atsindaha nde, ubaaleele imbuli. A hu li na upfuta mu nde tso hoole ve. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Moose aviidi benu Mikele. Ka muutu tso mumosi mu benu a hali mu ukiinza myo ve. Mu hima benu lili mu usaha uduba me?» <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Konge a baatu yaafutili bunuubu: «We na tengo! Na li mu usaha uduba we?» <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yisu afutili: «Mu vanga ndulu limosi la kimuhili li me miitsa, benu boosi limiipadumana! <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Tsimaani ati: Moose atuma benu mu ubaakete baana ba bahala. Ka, a Moose avoli kesili mo yiina ve. Kesili mo yiina yaamata huli bakaaha<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10-13">Mba 17.10-13</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lev 12.3</ref></char></note> ba bisu baatsomi. Benu lili mu ukete baatu mu ilumbu hya saba. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Benu lili mu usa buuna mu ukiinza Mikele mya Moose. Mu ki tooni benu lili mu ukwila me kesi, ŋa me miimbeloso muutu wu mutindala mu ilumbu hya saba? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Nyahaani usilasa misamu mu monihili a mu misu. Ka baasilasaani misamu bu hwafwana<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:15">Lev 19.15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:4">Esa 11.4</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Bisu Yeruselemi bakima baakaleele: «Nde wu, me ni wu bali mu usaha uduba? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Monwaani: nde li mu utoyo ŋa miisu ma baatu, na baatu a bali mu uleele nde pasi dyaambu ve! Buni! Bakuutu ba bisu bamiisilasa ti nde ni Kristo? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Mu ilumbu hi Kristo huuya, muutu tso mumosi a huyaaba hu nde amiimata ve. Ka nde wunuuwu, bisu liyaabi huni nde amiimata.»<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Yisu akalongese mu litandala la nzo a Nzambi. Nde asyenuli ndaha na uleele: «Mu mbuli benu liyaabi na me ndi, na huni me miimata? Me a hanza mu lituma la me mwakulu ve. Ka wu atsindaha me wu akuha ali. Benu a liyaabi nde ve. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Me, me nzaabi nde, mu tooni ati me miimata huli nde, na ni nde atsindaha me.» <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Buuna, bo baasahi ukaanga nde. Ka muutu tso mumosi a hatwali ubembe nde ve, bu taangu a nde yaba kini a yatoodi ve. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Ka, ba banzuhisini ŋa hati la konge a baatu, baasili nde imiinu na baakaleele: «Ŋa Kristo huuya, nde usa biliimbu bya kimuhili bi byalutahala bi nde wunuwu ali mu usa?»<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bafarisi bamiitsindaha baatu mu ukaanga Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Bafarisi baayuhi ma baatu baakaŋono mu tooni a Yisu. Bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na Bafarisi baatsindihi bakeedi mu uyakanga nde. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yisu ni uleele: «Me kini na benu mu mwaana a taangu hoole, titswene me tsa nzyene huli wu atsindaha me. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Benu sa lisaha me, na benu a luusoolo me ve. Na huuna hu me umba, benu a luutwala uyene ve.» <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Bayudaayo baalelisini: «Nde huni ali mu dwe, mana bisu luuvelesoolo nde? Nde ka huli Bayudaayo ba bubaatsahala ŋa hati li Bangeleke nde huyene, buuve Bangeleke huuyalongese? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Mambu ma nde amiipalisa maniima: “Benu sa lisaha me, na benu a luusoolo me ve” na “Huuna hu me umba, benu a luutwala uyene ve”. Hima mo mamoole matondi uleele?»<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu ni mamba ma moonyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Ilumbu hya tsukusu mukungi, ilumbu hi hyafulala tsongo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:36">Lev 23.36</ref></char></note>, Yisu atelimi, na asyenuli ndaha: «Tso muutu li na peyu a mamba, aya huli me, na anywa. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Pasi muutu wu li mu usiila me imiinu, “banzali baa mamba ma moonyi sa bapala mu mutima a nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Zak 14.8</ref> </char></note>”, we bu Libuku la Ngidi lili mu uleele.» <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Yisu haleeli buuna, mu tooni a Livupu la Nzambi li boosi ba baasiidi imiinu mu nde, baafwana uyaka. Mu taangu mo yiina, Nzambi aba kini a haviidi Livupu ve, mu tooni ati Yisu aba kini a hayaki muyusu ve.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Bu baatu ba ŋa hati la konge baayuhi mambu mo maana, bamosi baakaleele: «Nde wunuuwu, mbuli ni mumbihuli mo!» <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Bakima baakaleele: «Nde ni Kristo!» Na bakima kaka baakafuula: «Kristo utwala upala mu itaanzi hya Ngalili?<verse eid="JHN 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Mabuuku ma Ngidi mali mu uleele ti Kristo uba wu imbisa hya pfumu Davidi na nde upala mu Betelemi, bula bwa Davidi.»<verse eid="JHN 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Na baatu baakabuhi mu tooni a Yisu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Bamosi baakatondo ti bakaanga nde, ka muutu tso mumosi a habembi nde ve.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakuutu bamiibisa usa imiinu mu Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Bakeedi baafutihi huli bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na baa Bafarisi na baafuuli bo: «Mu hima benu livelibehe nde?» <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Bakeedi baafutili: «A hu li na muutu wu amiitoyo we bahala mo liina ve.» <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Bafarisi baakaali bo: «Benu kaka limiisinga ubwa mu soho mo liniili? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Hu li na mumosi mu bakuutu, buuve mumosi mu Bafarisi, wu sili nde imiinu? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Ka baatu mobaniba ba baaveleyaba Mikele mya Moose, ba baasinga bali!»<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Nikodemo aba mumosi mu Bafarisi ba baaba ŋaana. Nde wuuna wu ayamono Yisu hutsomi. Nde aleeli bo: <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />«Mu mikele mya bisu a benu, utwala utsundasa muutu hwavele umayuha nde, na umayaaba ma nde hasa ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:16">Pfu 1.16</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Bo baafutili nde bunuubu: «We kaka musi Ngalili we li? Kengese Mabasonehe na we sa mono ti mumbihuli tso mumosi a hupala mu Ngalili ve.» [<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Titswene, muutu-muutu ayeni hu nzo a nde.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu na mukaasu wu bamiikanga mu mayamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Yisu ayeni hu isyelo hya Olive. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Tsumba a ngwali, nde afutihi hu nzo a Nzambi, na baatu boosi baayidi huli nde. Nde atsahili na akalongese bo.<verse eid="JHN 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Bafarisi na milongisi mi Mikele, baabehili nde mukaasu mumosi wu baakangi mu usa mayamba. Bo baasuusi nde ŋa butima bwa baatu boosi, <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />na baaleeli Yisu: «Mulongisi, bamiikaanga mukaasu mo wunuuwu mu usa mayamba. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Mutso Mikele, Moose atuma bisu mu uduba mu mamanya<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lev 20.10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:22-24">Pfu 22.22-24</ref></char></note>, bakaasu ba we nde. Ka we buni leeli?»<verse eid="JHN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Bo baaviidi nde hyuhu mo hiina mu utehele nde mweto, mana bakese nde. Ka Yisu abaandimi, na nde akasonehe mu mulembo mu toto. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Bu bo baavatini mu uva nde byuhu, Yisu ateleme, aleeli bo: «Tso ŋa hati la benu hu li na muutu wu avelesa lisumu, abaandiha ulanga nde manya.» <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Nde abwebandama mu usonehe mu toto. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Bu bo baayuhi buuna, bo baavyasuhi mumosi mumosi, ubaandiha mu bakuutu. Yisu asaali siha na mukaasu wu aba ŋa butima bu litandala ŋaana.<verse eid="JHN 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yisu abweteleme, aleeli nde: «Mukaasu, ba bakakese we ka ba bo? Muutu tso mumosi a hatsundisi we ve?» <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Mukaasu ni ufutala ti: «Muutu ve, Pfumu.» Na Yisu aleeli nde: «Me kaka a utsundasa we ve. Yene! Ka umata loloyi, a habwesumaha.»]<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu ni liyalala la tsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yisu abweleele konge a baatu: «Me ni liyalala la tsi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:6">Esa 49.6</ref></char></note>. Muutu wu uduukala me a hu udyata mu piipidi ve, ka nde sa abaha liyalala la moonyi.»<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Titswene Bafarisi baaleeli nde: «We, we ubaata imbangi mu we mwakulu. Ni mu buuna imbangi hya we a hili hya mbuli ve.» <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yisu afutili bo: «Tso me ndi mu uta imbangi mu me mwakulu, imbangi hya me hili hya mbuli. Mu tooni ati, me nzaabi hu me amata, na hu me ndi mu unzyene. Ka benu a liyaabi hu me amata, na hu me ndi mu unzyene ve. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Benu libaatsundasa mu imuutu. Ka me a handi mu utsundasa muutu ve. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Ka tso me ndi mu utsundasa, tsundusu a me yili yi yaafwana. Mu tooni ati, me ndi itwadi na Taata wu atsindaha me. Tso me tsundisi, me a hutsundasa siha ve. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Baasonehe mu Mikele mya benu ti tso baatu boole baatiidi imbangi ni hyo imosi, imbangi hya bo hili hya mbuli<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Pfu 17.6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19.15</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 35:30">Mat 35.30</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Me umbaata imbangi mu me mwakulu, na Taata wu atsindaha me, ubaata kaka imbangi mu me.» <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Na bo baafuuli nde: «Taata a we huni a li?» Yisu afutili: «Benu a layaaba me ve, tso Taata a me ve. Kini benu layaaba me, benu likiiyaaba kaka Taata a me.»<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yisu haleeli mambu mo maana, ŋa nde haba mu ulongese mu nzo a Nzambi, bebele na iswehili hi bungodu. Muutu tso mumosi a hakangi nde ve, mu tooni ati taangu a nde aba kini a yatoodi ve.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu uyabisa nzyenili a nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yisu abweleele bo: «Me aka mu unzyene, benu sa lisaha me, ka benu sa likwa mu masumu ma benu. Benu a luutwala uyene hu me ndi mu unzyene ve.» <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Bayudaayo baakalelesene: «Nde li mu uleele ti: “Benu a lutwala uya hu me ndi mu unzyene ve.” Be nde ka linyutu huduba?» <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yisu afutili: «Benu lili baa ŋa toto, me ndi wa hu yulu. Benu lili baa tsi mo yiniiyi. Me a handi wa tsi mo yiniiyi ve. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Ni mu buuna, me ndeeli ti benu luukwa mu masumu ma benu. Ka tso benu ali siidi imiinu ve ti “me, me ndi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:14-15">Pal 3.14-15</ref></char></note>”, benu sa likwa mu masumu ma benu.» <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Bo ni ufuula nde: «We na we li?» Yisu afutili: «Me ndi muutu wu li mu uyabisa benu lo umata mbandu. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Me ndi na ma manzuhisini ma uleele mu benu, na ma manzuhisini ma utsundasa benu. Ka wu atsindaha me ubaaleele imbuli, na me umbandeele huli baatu boosi mambu ma me umbanzuha huli nde.»<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Bo abaatsikihi ve ti nde mu Taata a nde hakatoyo. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Ni mu buuna Yisu habweleele: «Ŋa benu lusyenolo Mwana a Muutu, ŋaana ni ŋa benu luuyaaba ti “me, me ndi”. Mu taangu mo yiina, benu luutsikaha ti, me a handi mu utsa pasi dyaambu mu me mwakulu ve. Ka me ndi mu utoyo ndulu ma Taata a me haalongese me. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Wu atsindaha me li itwadi na me. Nde a hasiisa me siha ve. Mu tooni ati, me umbaapanga taangu yoosi ma nde ubaatondo.» <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Bu Yisu hakatoyo buuna, ba banzuhisini baasiidi imiinu mu nde.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imbisa hya Abrahami hya mbuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yisu aleeli huli Bayudaayo ba baasiidi imiinu mu nde: «Tso benu likwilili mu mikuma mya me, mu mbuli benu lili bayihi ba me. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Benu sa liyaaba imbuli, na imbuli sa hiva benu bunyanga.» <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Bo baafutili nde: «Bisu lili ba imbisa hya Abrahami. Bisu kini a laabeedi baviha ba muutu ve. Buni we utwala uleele ti: “Benu sa liba bunyanga”?» <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yisu afutili bo: «Mu mbuli mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, pasi muutu wu usumaha, nde li muviha lisumu. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Muviha a hali musi ibaandu ve. Ka mwaana ubaakwilala mu hyo. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Ka tso Mwana viidi benu bunyanga, benu sa liba bunyanga bwa mbuli a mbuli. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Me nzaabi ti benu lili baa imbisa hya Abrahami. Ka benu lili mu usaha manzila ma uduba me. Mu tooni ati, benu a lili mu usiinga mikuma mya me ve. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Me ndi mu undeele ma me amono huli Taata a me. Ka uto ti benu, saani ma benu laayuhi huli taata a benu.»<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Bo baafutili: «Taata a bisu Abrahami.» Yisu ni uleele bo: «Tso benu lili baana ba Abrahami, benu likiisa mavaanga ma nde. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Ka bunuubu, me wu ndi mu undeele benu imbuli hi me anziha huli Nzambi, benu lili mu usaha uduba me. Abrahami a hasiidi buuna ve. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Benu lili mu usa mavaanga we ma taata a benu.» Bo ni uleele nde: «Bisu a lili baana ba baabuta mu mayamba ve. Bisu lili na Taata ndulu mumosi, ni Nzambi.»<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yisu afutili bo: «Tso Nzambi li mu mbuli Taata a benu, benu likiiba na litondo mu me. Mu tooni ati, me mu Nzambi apala na, ni mu nde me ndi. Me a hanza mu matsimi ma me mwakulu ve, ka mu ma wu atsindaha me. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Benu laaveletsikaha biyambilili bya me, bu benu laaveletwala uyaka mikuma mya me. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Taata a benu mukuyi. Na benu litondi ukuhasa ma taata a benu ubaatondo usa. Nde li mudubi umata mbandu. Nde a hali hutso imbuli ve, mu tooni ati imbuli a hili mu nde ve. Ŋa nde ubaasuunda mapfuta, mo maakwelene na mbiili a nde. Mu mbuli nde ni mupfuti, na nde li taata mapfuta. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Ka me, bu me ndi mu undeele imbuli, benu a lili mu usiila me imiinu ve. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Na mu benu utwala umweese ti me amiitsumaha? Na tso me ndi mu undeele imbuli, mu hima benu laavelesiila me imiinu? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Muutu wu li wa Nzambi, ubaayuha mambu ma Nzambi. Benu a lili mu uyuha ve, mu tooni ati benu a lili baana ba Nzambi ve.»<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Bayudaayo baafutili: «Bisu a lili na mbiinga mu uleele ve ti we musi Samariya, nga livupu la tengo?» <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yisu afutili bo: «Me a handi na livupu la tengo ve. Ka me umbaakiinza Taata a me, na benu lili mu upenye me. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Me a handi mu utsaha muyusu a me mwakulu ve. Hu li na mumosi wu ubaasahila me muyusu, ni nde wuuna wu ubaatsikaha misamu na bukuhu bwosi. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Mu mbuli, mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, pasi wu ukeelese mikuma mya me a humono lipfu ve ka sa akwilala.»<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Bayudaayo baafutili: «Bunuubu, bisu limiisilasa ti we na livupu la tengo! Abrahami akwidi, mimbihuli kaka myakwidi, na we li mu uleele: “Pasi muutu wu ukeelese mikuma mya me, nde a humono lipfu ve, na nde ukwilala mu bilima na bilima.” <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />We alutaala taata a bisu Abrahami wu akwidi? Mimbihuli kaka myakwidi. Ka we na li? We hima tondi umweese?» <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yisu afutili bo: «Tso me ndi mu unzuusa me mwakulu, muyusu a me a hali na tsongo ve. Ka Taata a me ni wu ubaamweese muyusu a me. Benu lili mu uleele ti: “Nde li Nzambi a bisu”. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Benu a liyaabi nde ve, ka me, me nzaabi nde. Tso me ndeeli ti me a hanzaabi nde ve, me umba mupfuti we benu. Ka me nzaabi nde, na me umbaakeelese mikuma mya nde. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Abrahami, taata a benu asalumini mu kinya, mu tsimi yi umono ilumbu hya nziili a me. Nde amoni hyo na nde aluuli mu kinya.» <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Bayudaayo baaleeli nde: «We a hakuhasa tso maku mataanu (50) ma bilima ve, na we leele ti: “Me amoni Abrahami”?» <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yisu afutili bo: «Mu mbuli mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, tswamina babuta Abrahami, “me, me ndi”.» <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Humbisa uyuha mambu mo maana, bo baatoli mamanya mu ulanga nde, ka Yisu aswemi na apali mu nzo a Nzambi.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso inzimana hi imbutala-ngu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Bu Yisu haakavyoho mu nzila, nde amoni inzimana hi imbutala-ngu. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Bayihi ba nde baafuuli nde: «Rabi, mu hima baabuta muutu mo wunuuwu inzimana. Mu tooni masumu ma nde mwakulu, vo ti mu ma taata na ma ngu a nde?» <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yisu afutili: «Huba nde, buuve ngu a nde na taata a nde a baasumihi ve. Ka nde ali inzimana hi imbutala-ngu, mana mavaanga ma Nzambi mamonehele mu nde. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Bisu a benu lafwana ukuhasa mavaanga ma wu atsindaha me, bu busi bukini bwakya. Bu busi buuyila, muutu ubwetwala usala ve. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Bu me kini mu tsi, me ndi liyalala la baatu boosi.»<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Nde amana buuna uleele, nde atuuli maate mu toto. Na nde avangi libonzi mu maate ma nde. Titswene, nde akili lo mu miisu ma inzimana. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Na nde ni uleele: «Yene yaswaha mbalanga hu idiinga hya Silowa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 20:20">2Pf 20.20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:6">Esa 8.6</ref> </char></note>.» Silowa, mbinduli ni ti, «muutu wu baatsindaha». Nde ayeni, ayaswaha mbalanga, na bu hayafutaha, miisu ma nde maadibumi. <verse eid="JHN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Ba baaba ŋa pedu a nde na ba baakamono nde mu uvondo baatu mbongo, baakaleele: «Wunuuwu, a ni muutu wu akatsahala ŋa toto na ubaavondo mbongo ve?» <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Bamosi baakaleele: «Ni nde.» Bakima baakaleele: «Naana, a nde ve! Ka wunuuwu na ikeboso hya nde.» Ka nde mwakulu akaleele: «A ni me hwa me!» <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Buuna, bo baabwefuula nde: «Ka buni miisu ma we mamiidibuma?» <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Nde afutili: «Muutu nga nduhi a Yisu vaangi libonzi, kili me lo mu miisu, na leeli: “Yene yaswaha mbalanga a we hu idiinga hya Silowa.” Bu me nzatswaha mbalanga, miisu ma me ni ŋa madibumi!» <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Bo ni ufuula nde: «Ka muutu mo wuuna huni a li?» Nde afutili: «Me a hanzaabi ve.»<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Bo baabiti wu aba inzimana huli Bafarisi. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Kaahu aba ilumbu hya saba, ŋa Yisu havangi libonzi na hadibuli nde miisu. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Ni buuna, Bafarisi kaka bafuuli nde buni miisu ma nde maadibumi. Na nde ayabisi bo: «Nde akili me libonzi mu miisu. Bu me anzatswaha mbalanga, miisu ma me ni udibuma.» <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Bafarisi bamosi baakaleele: «Muutu mo wu miivanga bunuubu, utwala uba wa Nzambi ve. Mu tooni ati, nde a hubaakiinza mukele a ilumbu hya saba ve.» Bakima baakaleele: «Buni muutu nga masumu hutwala usa biliimbu bya kimuhili biniibi? Ni mu buuna, kabuhili ya monihili ŋa hati la bo.» <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Bafarisi baabwefuula inzimana: «Ka we buni li mu uleele mu nde wu midibula miisu ma we?» Nde afutili: «Nde Mumbihuli ali.»<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Ka, batumi baa Bayudaayo a baasiidi imiinu ve ti muutu mo wunuuwu aba inzimana, na nde aka mu umono. Ni mu buuna, bo baatsihi ngu na taata a nde. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Bo baafuuli bo: «Nde wunuuwu mwaana a benu, wu benu lili mu uleele ti nde inzimana baabuuti? Ka buni loloyi, nde aka mu umono?» <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Ngu na taata a nde baafutili: «Bisu liyaabi ti nde mwaana a bisu ali, na ti bisu laabuti nde inzimana. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Ka mu uyaaba buni nde aka mu umono loloyi, bisu a liyaabi ve. Buuve mu ayaba na adibula nde miisu, bisu a liyaabi kaka ve. Fuulaani nde mwakulu! Nde amiibuuha mu uyabisa benu mambu ma mayiili nde.» <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Bo baaleeli buuna mu tooni ati bo baaba na boomo bu batumi baa Bayudaayo. Batumi baa Bayudaayo baayuhisini mu ubinga mu nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo, pasi muutu wu usilasa ti Yisu ni Kristo. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Ni mu buuna, ngu na taata a nde baaleeli: «Nde amiibuuha, fuulaani nde mwakulu!»<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Bafarisi baabwetsiha muutu wu aba inzimana, tsiha la moole na baaleeli nde: «Yuusa Nzambi mu uleele imbuli. Bisu liyaabi ti bahala mo liina, nga masumu ali.» <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Nde afutili bo: «Tso nde li nga masumu, me anzaabi hwa me ve. Li me nzaabi nduli dyaambu limosi: me mbeedi inzimana, loloyi me ka mu umono.» <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Bo baafuuli nde: «Hima nde asiidi we? Buni nde adibuli we miisu?» <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Nde afutili: «Me mbeedi amiindeele benu lo, na benu aliyuhi ve. Mu hima benu litondi ubweyuha musamu mo wuuna? Benu kaka bayihi ba nde litondi uba?» <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Bo baatuhi nde na baaleeli: «Muyihi a nde ni we! Bisu bayihi ba Moose. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Bisu liyaabi ti Nzambi ayambili na Moose. Ka nde wunuuwu, bisu a liyaabi nde huni hamata ve.» <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Bahala mo ni ufutala bo: «La kimuhili ni liniili: Benu a liyaabi nde huni hamata ve, ka nde miidibula me miisu. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Bisu liyaabi ti Nzambi a hubaayuhala banga masumu ve. Ka nde ubaasiingala pasi muutu wu ubaakiinza nde na wu ubaasa litondo la nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:16">Mkg 34.16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 66:18">66.18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:15">Esa 1.15</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 15:29">Mak 15.29</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Bisu a laamayuha ve ti muutu amiidibula miisu ma inzimana hi imbutala-ngu. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Ka tso muutu mo wunuuwu a hamata huli Nzambi ve, nde a hakiitwala usa dyaambu la buuna ve.» <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Bo baafutili nde: «Bu baabuta we, we li nga masumu umata hu mutswe te hu miilu, na we tondi ulongese bisu?» Buuna bo baabingi nde mu nzo a Nzambi.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yisu ayuha ti bo baabingi nde mu nzo a Nzambi, nde ayabwana nde na aleeli: «We li mu usa imiinu mu Mwana a Muutu?» <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Nde afutili: «Pfumu, Mwana a Muutu na ali, mana me tsiila nde imiinu?» <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yisu aleeli nde: «We miimono nde. Wu li mu utoyo na we, ni nde.» <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Nde aleeli: «Pfumu, me ndi mu utsiila we imiinu.» Na nde akongimini ŋa busu bwa Yisu. <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Titswene, Yisu aleeli nde: «Me miinza mu tsi mo yiniiyi, mana binzimana bimono, na ba bali mu umono, bakituha binzimana. Tsundusu a me ni yiina.» <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Mwana kabu li Bafarisi ba baaba ŋa pedu a nde, ba baayuhi mambu mo maana, ni ufuula Yisu: «Bisu kaka binzimana lili?» <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yisu afutili bo: «Tso benu libeedi binzimana, benu a likiiba na masumu ve. Ka benu lili mu uleele: “Bisu lili mu umono.” Ni mu buuna, benu luukwilala banga masumu.»<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu mukeelisi mameme wu mubwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />«Mu mbuli, mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, muutu wu ukoto mu mumbu mameme, hwavele uvyohele ŋa ikotili, ka nde alendoho mumbu, nde wuuna li mwibi na mutsali. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Ka muutu wu li mu uvyohele mu ikotili, nde li mukeelisi mameme. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Keedi a mumbu ubaadibula ikotili mana mukeelisi mameme akoto. Mameme mu baayuha ndaha a nde. Nde ubaateele mameme, pasi lo mu nduhi a lo, na nde ubaabita mo hu mbadi. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Bu nde amipalisa mameme ma nde moosi, nde ubaayene ŋa busu bwa mo. Mameme mu baaduukala nde mu tooni ati, mo maayaaba ndaha a nde. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Mo a muuduukala mwenyi tso hoole ve. Ka mo sa mabata nde lala, mu tooni ati mo a maayaaba ndaha a byenyi ve.»<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yisu atiidi bo kuma mo yiina, ka bo a baatsikihi ma nde haakaleele bo ve. <verse eid="JHN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Yisu abweleele bo: «Mu mbuli mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, me, ni ikotili hya mumbu mameme. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Boosi ba baateehili me, bali biibi na baataani<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:1-2">Yel 23.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:2-3">Ezk 34.2-3</ref></char></note>. Ka mameme a maayuhili bo ve. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Me, ni ikotili. Tso muutu vyohili mu me, nde sa afuuha. Nde sa akoto na upala na bunyanga, na nde sa abaha byudya. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Mwibi ubaaya ndulu mu uyiba, mu uduba na mu utsala. Ka me anza, mana mameme mabaha moonyi, moonyi wu afulala.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Me, me ndi mukeelisi mameme wu mubwe. Mukeelisi mameme<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 23:1">Mkg 23.1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:11">Esa 40.11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:15">Ezk 34.15</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:24">37.24</ref> </char></note> ubaayeholo moonyi a nde mu mameme ma nde. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Muutu wu ubaasala ndulu mu ubaha mbongo, a hali mukeelisi mameme wa mbuli ve. Bu mameme maavele ma nde, nde ubaatiimba mo na ubaabata bu nde amiimono miinzi. Na minzi ubaakanga mameme, na utsala mo. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Muutu mo wunuwu ubaasala ndulu mu ubaha mbongo, ka a mu ukeelese mameme ve. Mu tooni ati, nde a hali na tsimi a mo ve. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Me, me ndi mukeelisi mameme wu mubwe. Me anzaaba mameme ma me, na ma me kaka maayaaba me. <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />We bu Taata hayaaba me, me kaka anzaaba Taata. Na me umbaanzyeholo moonyi a me mu mameme ma me. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Me ndi na mameme makima ma maavele mutso a mumbu mo wunuwu. Me apfwana ubita kaka mo. Mo sa mayuha ndaha a me, na sa maba ndulu konge mameme mosi, mukeelisi kaka mumosi.<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Ni buuna, Taata hatondo me. Ka tso Taata hatondo me, mu tooni ati, me umbaanzyeholo moonyi a me, mana me mbwembaha nde wu munyatihi. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />A hu li na muutu wu umaasa me nde ve. Ka me umbaanzyeholo nde mu litondo la me mwakulu. Me ndi na matwala ma uva moonyi, na me ndi na matwala ma ubwevolo nde. Buuna ni bu Taata a me hatuma me.»<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Kabuhili yabwemonehele ŋa hati li Bayudaayo, mu tooni a mikuma mo miina. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Ba banzuhisini ŋa hati la bo baakaleele: «Nde na livupu la tengo ali. Nde na ladi. Mu hima benu libaayuhala nde?» <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Bakima baakafutala: «Mambu mo maniima a mali ma nga livupu la tengo ve. Nga livupu la tengo utwala udibula miisu ma binzimana?»<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bayudaayo bamiinyasula Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Baakavyoso mukungi a tsyemili a nzo a Nzambi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mukungi wu baakatemeleese hu tsukusu a tsungi wa kuumi na boole, mu uyibwala moonyi mu likutuunu libaasyemi diiku la nzo a Nzambi, mu taangu ya Makabe.</char></note> hu Yeruselemi. Aba mu taangu a mutubu. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yisu akataangila mu lipombo la Salomooni, hu litandala la nzo a Nzambi. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Bayudaayo baayadiinga nde na baaleeli nde: «Natee ki taangu we usiisa bisu hutso idiba? Tso mbuli we ni Kristo, yabisa bisu paayalala.» <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yisu afutili bo: «Me amiindeele benu lo, na benu a lili mu usiila me imiinu ve. Mavaanga ma me ndi mu utsa mu nduhi a Taata a me, mali mu utiila me imbangi. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Ka benu a lili mu usa imiinu ve, mu tooni ati benu a lili mameme ma me ve. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Mameme ma me mu baayuha ndaha a me. Me nzaabi mo, na mo mali mu uduukala me. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Me ndi mu unzyeholo mo moonyi wu bilima na bilima: mo a muukwa ve. A hu li na muutu wu utwala upatula mo ŋa kaka la me ve. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Taata a me wu ava me mameme, aluutala boosi mu bunene. A hu li na muutu wu utwala upatula pasi hyo ŋa kaka la Taata ve. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Bisu a Taata lili muutu mumosi.»<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Bayudaayo baabwetolo mamanya mu ulanga nde. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yisu abweleele bo: «Me amweese benu mavaanga ma mabwe, mu matwala ma Taata. Benu mu ki vanga lilibwe benu litondi uduba me mu mamanya?» <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Bayudaayo baafutili nde: «A mu tooni a vanga lilibwe bisu luuduba we ve. Ka mu tooni a bu we li mu usafula bungidi bwa Nzambi. Na we wu li ndulu muutu, we li mu ubilumana ti we Nzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lev 24.16</ref> </char></note>!»<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yisu afutili bo: «Mu Mikele mya benu a baasonehe ve ti: “Me ndeeli, benu lili banzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Mkg 82.6</ref> </char></note>”? <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Hutso Mabuuku ma Ngidi, Nzambi li mu uteele baatu ba baayaki mambu ma nde: “banzambi”. Ka muutu tso mumosi, utwala ufwinzala Mabasonehe ma Ngidi ve. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Na me, Taata asoolo me na nde atsindaha me mu tsi. Ni mu buuna, me ndeeli ti: “Me ndi Mwana Nzambi.” Ka buni benu lili mu uleele ti me ndi mu utsafula Nzambi? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Tso me a handi mu utsa mavaanga ma Taata a me ve, a laasiila me imiinu! <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Ka tso me ndi me utsa mo, tso bu benu luvelesiila me imiinu, saani imiinu mu mavaanga mo maniima. Yaabaani na tsikahaani ti, Taata li mu me na me ndi mu Taata.» <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Bo baabwesaha ukaanga nde, ka nde apatuhi ŋa myoho mya bo.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Yisu abweyene hu simu liina la Yolodani, ŋa mbuha yi Yowani habaandihi utondehe na nde atsahili huuna. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Baatu ba banzuhisini baayidi huli nde, na baakaleele: «Yowani a hasiidi iliimbu hya kimuhili tso imosi ve. Ka moosi ma nde haleeli mu bahala mo linili, maaba ma mbuli.» <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Na huuna, ba banzuhisini baasiidi imiinu mu Yisu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Lipfu la Lazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Hwaba na mubeedu mumosi, nduhi a nde Lazaro. Nde aba musi Betanya, bula bwa Mariya na Malata, bakedi ba nde. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Mariya ni wu apuupili nyafi mu miilu mya Pfumu na ukombolo myo mu nanga a nde. Wu aba mu ubeele ni kedi a nde Lazaro. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Bakedi ba nde baboole, baatsindihi muutu mu uyateele Yisu na uyabisa nde ti: «Pfumu, mono mbaahi a we, wu we atondo amiibeele.» <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Yisu amana uyuha buuna, nde aleeli: «Bubeedu mo bunuubu a bu lipfu ve. Ka bwo sa bubehe muyusu a Nzambi, mana bayusa Mwana a Nzambi mu bwo.» <verse eid="JHN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yisu aba asinzatondo Malata na baana ba ngu a nde Mariya na Lazaro. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Bu nde hayuhi ti Lazaro aba aka mubeedu, buuna, nde abwetsahala bilumbu byole ŋa mbuha yi nde haba. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Titswene, nde aleeli huli bayihi ba nde: «Nyaha lifutahaani hu Yude.» <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Bayihi baaleeli nde: «Rabi, Bayudaayo bakasaha uduba we mu mamanya matsuhu mo maniima. Buni! We bwefutaha huuna?» <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yisu afutili: «Mu ilumbu hu li na mangunga kuumi na moole (12). Tso muutu li mu udyenge ŋa nyangu, nde a hukuba baku ve, mu tooni ati nde ubaamono mu liyalala. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Ka tso muutu li mu udyenge butsuhu, nde ubaakuba baku, mu tooni ati, nde utwala ubwemono bubwe ve.»<verse eid="JHN 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Ŋa yulu a mambu mo maniima, nde aleeli bo: «Lazaro, mbaahi a bisu amiibwamina, ka me unzatsuula nde.» <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Bayihi baaleeli nde: «Pfumu, tso nde amiibwamina, nde ubeeloho.» <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Yisu akayambila mu lipfu la Lazaro. Ka bayihi ba nde baakatsima ti Yisu mu tolo la Lazaro hakayambila. Kaahu aba tolo li lipfu. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Bunuubu, Yisu aleeli bo paayalala: «Lazaro amiikwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Ka me ndi na kinya mu benu, bu me mbeedi avele huuna. Ni mu liina, benu luusiila me imiinu. Ka tswendaani huli nde.» <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Tomasi nga kuumbu «Vasa», aleeli bayihi bakima: «Tswendaani bisu a benu kaka, mana liyakwaani na Mulongisi.»<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Ŋa Yisu hayato, nde ayuhi ti Lazaro aka hutso a ngila umata bilumbu bina. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Bula bwa Betanya aba bwa tahuha na Yeruselemi, bebele mu bakilometere batatu. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Bayudaayo ba banzuhisini baayidi huli Mariya na Malata, mu ubombesele bo mu lipfu la kedi a bo. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Bu Malata hayuhi ti Yisu mu uya ali, nde ayabwana nde. Ka Mariya asaali matsahala hu nzo. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Malata aleeli Yisu: «Pfumu, kini we aba ŋaana, kedi a me a hakiikwa ve. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Ka buunubu, me nzaabi ti pasi hi we uvondo huli Nzambi, nde uva we hyo.» <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yisu aleeli nde: «Kedi a we sa asuuha mu lipfu.» <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Malata afutili: «Me nzaabi ti nde sa asuuha mu tsuuhili a babakwa, mu ilumbu hya tsyelele<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12.2</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yisu aleeli nde: «Me, me ni tsuuhili na moonyi. Pasi muutu wu usiila me imiinu, sa aba moonyi, tso nde kwidi. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Na pasi muutu wu li moonyi, na wu usiila me imiinu, a hukwa ve. We li mu usiila mambu mo maniima imiinu?» <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Malata aleeli: «Eye Pfumu, me ndi mu utsa imiinu ti we ni Kristo, Mwana a Nzambi, wu baatu ba tsi baakakeele.»<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miisuula Lazaro mu lipfu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Bu Malata hamani uleele buuna, nde ayateele Mariya mwaana a ngu a nde. Na aleeli nde mu tswehi: «Mulongisi ni ŋaniiŋa ali, nde li mu uteele we.» <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Bu Mariya hayuhi buuna, nde amani mu tele mu mawasa na ayeni huli Yisu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Yisu aba kini ŋa tsomo a bula, ŋa mbuha yi Malata habwani nde. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Bayudaayo ba baaba hutso a nzo na Mariya mu ubombesele nde, baamoni nde mu uteleme mawasa na upala. Bo baaduukili nde, bu baakatsima ti nde hu ngila ali mu uyene hu uyalila.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Mariya atoodi ŋa Yisu haba. Bu nde hamoni Yisu, Mariya abwiidi ŋa miilu mya nde na aleeli: «Pfumu kini we abeedi ŋaana, kedi a me a hakiikwa ve.» <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Bu Yisu hamoni Mariya na Bayudaayo ba baadukili nde mu ulila, nde amoni lingebe na anyongi. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Nde afuuli bo: «Benu nde huni laasuusa?» Bo baafutili: «Pfumu, yanga yamono.» <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yisu alili. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Buuna, Bayudaayo baaleeli: «Monwaani buni nde habeedi hatondo nde!» <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Na bakima mu bo baaleeli: «Nde wunuuwu a ni wu adibuli miisu ma inzimana ve? Buni nde havelitwala usa kaka ti Lazaro avelekwa?»<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Bunuubu, Yisu abwemono lingebe li laafulala. Nde ayeni hu ngila. Ngila mo yiina aba we murali, wu kotili yaba baadibuha mu manya li linene. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yisu aleeli: «Masaani manya.» Malata, kedi a wu akwa afutili: «Pfumu, nde amiibaandiha upala tsulu. Mu tooni ati loloyi, huka biluumbi bina nde ali mutso a ngila.» <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yisu aleeli nde: «Me a handeele we ve ti, tso we sili me imiinu, we umono muyusu a Nzambi?» <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Baamaasi manya. Yisu asimbuli miisu hu yulu na aleeli: «Taata, me miipfutala matondo bu we miiyuhala me. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Me nzaabi ti we ubaayuhala me taangu yoosi. Ka me ndeeli buuna, mu tooni a konge a baatu mo baniba ba baadiinga me, mana bo basa imiinu ti ni we atsindaha me.» <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Bu nde hamani uleele buuna, nde asyenuli ndaha na mifudi myosi: «Lazaro, pala!» <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Wu akwa apali mu ngila, miilu na myoho baapoto birende, na mbalanga baafuungala lileeso. Yisu aleeli bo: «Nyangulaani nde na nyahulaani nde ayene.»<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pfuundu a bangu ba bangaanga mu Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Bayudaayo ba banzuhisini ŋa hati la ba baayidi huli Mariya, ba baamoni ma Yisu havangi, baasiidi imiinu mu nde. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Ka bakima ŋa hati la bo, baayamono Bafarisi na uyabisa bo ma Yisu havangi. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Buuna, bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na Bafarisi, baakuungi pfuundu banzonzi baa Bayudaayo, na baaleeli: «Bisu a benu hima lusaani? Mu tooni ati, nde li mu usa biliimbu bya kimuhili bi bilahi. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Bisu a benu linyaha nde mu usa mavaanga ma nde, baatu boosi sa basa imiinu mu nde. Na bisu Looma sa bayapatula byosi: nzo a Nzambi na tsi a bisu.»<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Mumosi mu bo, nga nduhi Kayifa, wu aba mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi watsomi mu ilima mo hiina, aleeli: «Benu a lili mu utsikaha pasi lo ve! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Benu a lili mu umono ve ti, hwafulala tsalu ti muutu akwa mu tooni a buli? Kini tsi yoosi yunyambana!» <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Kaahu Kayife a haleeli buuna mu matsimi ma nde mwakulu ve. Ka bu nde haba mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi watsomi mu ilima mo hiina, nde abihuli ti Yisu afwana ukwa mu tooni Bayudaayo boosi. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Ka lipfu, a ndulu mu tsi Bayudaayo ve, ka napa mu upfuuta mu nyutu mosi, baana ba Nzambi boosi ba baamiitsamuha mu toto yoosi.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Umata ilumbu mo hiina, bakuutu ba Bayudaayo baavoli kesili mu uduba Yisu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Ni mu buuna, Yisu hakabweveledyenge ŋa miisu ma Bayudaayo. Ka nde ayeni hu itaanzi hya bebele na kumu, hu musyenge wu bubaateele Ifrayima. Nde atsahili huuna na bayihi ba nde.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Paake, mukungi Bayudaayo, aba aka bebele. Baatu ba banzuhisini baayakuma hu Yeruselemi, mu utsyemese nyutu na muvumu. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Bu bo baaba mu litandala la nzo a Nzambi, bo baakasaha Yisu na baakalelesene: «Buni benu lili mu utsima? Nde a huuya hu mukungi ve?» <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi baatsomi na Bafarisi, baaviidi tumili mo yiniiyi: «Tso muutu yaabi huni Yisu ali, nde afwana uyabisa bisu, mana bisu likanga nde.»<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Mariya miipuupala nyafi mu miilu mya Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Bilumbu bisamunu, tswamina Paake yito, Yisu ayeni hu Betanya. Ni huuna hwaba Lazaro, muutu wu nde hasuuli mu babaakwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Baaviidi Yisu byudya bi Malata hakakaba. Lazaro aba mumosi mu ba baaba ŋa metse na nde. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Mariya avoli itutu hya nyafi ya talu yindahi ya nduhi a «nare», nde apuupili yo mu miilu mya Yisu na akombili nde miilu mu nanga a nde. Nzo yaluuli mu tsulu a nyafi mo yiina.<verse eid="JHN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Mumosi mu bayihi ba nde, nga nduhi a Yuda Isikaryoti, wu aba na matsimi ma uyeholo Yisu, aleeli: <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />«Mu hima bavelisuumbasa nyafi mo yiniiyi mu maku matatu (300) ma baa denye ma mbongo na uva mo huli biyaha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbongo yi yafwana na pfuta musalili yi ilima hi itindala.</char></note>?» <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Nde a haleeli buuna mu tooni a kwili lingebe mu biyaha ve, ka mu tooni ati nde aba muyibi. Bu nde hakakanga koome yi itwadi, nde akayiba mbongo yi baakasuusa muuna. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Ka Yisu aleeli nde: «Nyaha nde tsina! Nde asiidi buuna, mu uvangimasa ilumbu hya ndihili a me. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Benu sa libaaba na biyaha taangu yoosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Pfu 15.11</ref> </char></note>. Ka me, benu a luuba na me taangu yoosi ve.»<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Konge yinene yi Bayudaayo yaayuhi ti Yisu aba hu Betanya. Bo a baayeni huuna mu umono ndulu Yisu ve, ka mu umono kaka Lazaro, wu nde hasuuli mu babaakwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Buuna, bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi baavoli kesili mu uduba kaka Lazaro. <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />Bo baasahi uduba nde mu tooni ati, ba banzuhisini baasiisi bo, bu Bayudaayo baasiidi imiinu mu Yisu, mu tooni a Lazaro.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kotili a Yisu hu Yeruselemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Ilumbu hi hyaduukili, konge a baatu yinene yi yaayidi mu mukungi a Paake, yaayuhi ti Yisu akaya hu Yeruselemi. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Bo baavoli bihele, baapali mu musyenge mu uyabwana nde na baakafulaha: «Osana! Nzambi asyeme nde wu li mu uya mu nduhi a Pfumu! Nyaha Nzambi asyeme mutumi Isereli<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Mkg 118.25-26</ref> </char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yisu amoni buuru mumosi, nde atsahili ŋa yulu a nde. We bu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uyabisa:<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />«A baa na boomo ve, we nuumba a Syoni!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Mono mutumi a we li mu uya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">atsahala ŋa yulu a mwaana a buuru<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zak 9.9</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Hu mbaandihili, bayihi ba nde a baatsikihi ma maakavyoho ve. Ka humbisa a hu Yisu hasyenuhi mu muyusu, bo baayibuhili moonyi ti mambu mo maana aba baasonehe mu nde. Bo baayibuhili kaka moonyi mu mambu ma maavyohi mu ilumbu mo hiina.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Baatu boosi ba baaba ŋa Yisu haateeli Lazaro mu upala mu ngila, na usuula nde mu babaakwa, baakatiila nde imbangi mu ma bo baamoni. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Ni mu buuna konge a baatu yaayabwana nde, mu tooni ati bo baayuhi ti nde asiidi iliimbu hya kimuhili mo hiina. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Bafarisi baalelisini: «Bisu lili mu umono ti, bisu a benu a laatwala ve. Monwaani buni baatu boosi bali mu uduukala nde!»<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bangeleke bakima baatondi ubwana Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Hwaba na Bangeleke ŋa hati la baatu ba baakumisi hu Yeruselemi, mu ukunda Nzambi mu ilumbu hi mukungi a Paake. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Bo baayasusaha ŋa pedu a Filipo musi Betesayida, hu Ngalili na baafuuli nde: «Pfumu, bisu litondi umono Yisu.» <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filipo ayatoosele huli Andele, titswene Andele na Filipo baayayabisa Yisu.<verse eid="JHN 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yisu afutili bo: «Ngunga yimiito yi baafwana uyuusa Mwana a Muutu. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Mu mbuli, mu mbuli, me ndi mu undeele benu: tso libutu li libaava lipa a libwidi ŋa toto na ukwa ve, lo utwala ubuta ve. Ka tso lo likwidi, lo sa libuta mbutu yindahi. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Pasi muutu wu ubaatondo idiingu hya nde, ubaanyambasano hyo. Ka nde wuuna wu ubaabisa ukangama mu idiingu hya ŋa toto, sa abaha moonyi wu bilima na bilima. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Tso muutu tondi usalila me, nyaha nde aduukala me. Ni mu buuna, ŋa me ndi, musalili a me sa aba na me, na Taata a me sa ayusa nde.»<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu utoyo mu lipfu la nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />«Buunubu, muvumu a me li na mangongo. Ka ki lo me undeele? Me ndeele ti: “Taata yobolo me mu ngunga mapasi yiniiyi”? Naana! Me ti ni mu ukuhasa iteesi hya ngunga mo yiniiyi me anza. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Taata, yusa nduhi a we!» Na ndaha yaayuhini hu mayulu: «Me amiinzuusa yo, na me tsa mbwenzuusa yo.» <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Baatu ba baaba ŋaana, ba baayuhi ndaha mo yiina, baakaleele: «Wuuna bedi nzyedi.» Bakima baakaleele: «Pofi miitoyo na nde.» <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Yisu aleeli: «A mu tooni a me, ndaha mo yiniiyi yiyuhini ve. Ka mu tooni a benu. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Yiniiyi ka ni taangu yi Nzambi hutsundasa baatu ba tsi mo yiniiyi. Nde ubinga hu mbadi pfumu wu mubi wa tsi mo yiniiyi. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Na me, ŋa Nzambi husyenolo me ŋa yulu a toto, me umbehe baatu boosi huli me.» <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Nde hakaleele buuna, mu uyabisa kwili yi nde haakikwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Baatu baafutili nde: «Bisu laayiha mu libuuku li Mikele ti Kristo ukwilala<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Mkg 110.4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:6">Esa 9.6</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">Dan 7.14</ref> </char></note> bilima na bilima. Ka we buni we li mu uleele ti: “Mwana a Muutu bafwana usyenolo nde”? Mwana a Muutu mo ka na?» <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yisu aleeli bo: «Liyalala likini mwaana taangu hoole ŋa hati la benu. Hwadaani mu uyene, bu liyalala likini ŋa hati la benu, mana piipidi a yikimusa benu. Ka muutu wu ubaayene hutso a piipidi, a hubaayaaba huni nde ubaayene ve. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Bu benu likini na liyalala, saani imiinu mu liyalala, mana benu likituha baana ba liyalala.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 12:36">Kamini mutima Bayudaayo</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Yisu aleele buuna, nde ayasweme lala na bo.» <verse eid="JHN 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Tso bu nde hasiidi biliimbu bya kimuhili bi bilahi ŋa busu bwa bo, bo a baasili nde imiinu ve. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Buuna, ma mumbihuli Esaya haleeli maavangimi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">«Pfumu, na asiidi imiinu mu ibila hi bisu laatiidi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">Huli na Pfumu hamweesi matwala ma hoho hwa nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Esa 53.1</ref> </char></note>?»<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Bo a baatwali usa imiinu ve, mu tooni ati mumbihuli Esaya abweleele:<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />«Nzambi adibuhi miisu ma bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">nde aviidi bo kamini mutima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">mana bo bavelemono mu miisu ma bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">mana baveletsikaha mu mitima mya bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">mana bavelekingula buyedi na uyafutaha huli me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">kini me umbeeloso bo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Esa 6.9-10</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Maana ni mambu ma Esaya haleeli ŋa nde hamoni muyusu a Yisu, wu nde ali mu usangula.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Tso buuna, ba banzuhisini ŋa hati li bakuutu ba Bayudaayo baasiidi imiinu mu Yisu. Ka mu tooni Bafarisi, bo a baakasangula mo paayalala ve, mana a babingasa bo mu nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Mu tooni ati bo baakatondo muyusu wu ubaamata huli baatu, ka a wu ubaamata huli Nzambi ve.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miiyafuhasa baatu ba tsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Yisu aleeli mu mifudi: «Muutu wu li mu usiila me imiinu, a hubasiila hyo ndulu mu me ve, ka napa mu wuuna wu atsindaha me. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Na muutu wu miimono me, miimono napa wu atsindaha me. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Me anza mu tsi we liyalala. Pasi muutu wu usiila me imiinu, a hafwana ukwilala mu piipidi ve. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Tso muutu li mu uyuha mambu ma me, ka velisalila mo, me a handi mu utsundasa nde ve. Mu tooni ati, me a hanza mu utsundasa baatu ba tsi ve, ka mu uyobolo bo. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Muutu wu ubaanyanza me na uvelesiinga mambu ma me, amiibaha wu utsundasa nde. Ni mikuma mi me andeele myutsundasa nde, mu ilumbu hya tsyelele. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Mu tooni ati mambu ma me nzabisi benu, a mali ma me mwakulu ve. Ka nde mwakulu Taata wu atsindaha me, atuma me mambu ma me apfwana uleele na ulongese. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Na me nzaabi ti tumili a Taata yibaabita baatu hu moonyi wu bilima na bilima. Ni mu buuna, mambu moosi ma me ndi mu undeele, me ndi mu undeele mo we bu Taata haleele me.»<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu uswaha miilu mi bayihi ba nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Tswamina mukungi a Paake, Yisu ayaabi ti taangu a nde yi usiisa tsi mo yiniiyi, mu uyene huli Taata aba yaamiito. Nde aba atondo ba nde ba baaba mu tsi. Nde aba afula utondo bo natee hu tsukusu. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Bu Yisu na bayihi ba nde baakadya ilaambu hya tsitsaha, Mukuyi aba amiikotele mutima a Yuda, mwaana a Simoni Isikariyoti, mu usumbasa Yisu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yisu ayaabi ti Taata aviidi byosi mu lituma la myoho mya nde, na ti huli Nzambi nde hamati. Ka nde yaabi kaka ti nde ufutaha huli Nzambi. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Nde ateleme ŋa metse, amaasi muroopo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">muroopo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ikutu hi hyakulamana te hu miilu.</char></note> a nde, na avoli ileembe hya tsanda hi nde hapoti mu luungu la nde. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Titswene, nde ayitili mamba ŋa ikoombe, na abandihi uswaha miilu mi bayihi ba nde na ukombolo myo mu ileembe.<verse eid="JHN 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Yisu ato ŋa busu bwa Simoni Peetelo, Peetelo aleeli nde: «We wu li Pfumu, we swaha miilu mya me?» <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yisu afutili nde: « We a hali mu utsikaha ma me ndi mu utsa ve. Ka we sa bangula mo hu busu.» <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Peetelo aleeli nde: «Naana, we a huswaha miilu mya me ve.» Yisu afutili nde: «Me upeletswaha miilu mya we, we a huba itwadi na me ve.» <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simoni Peetelo aleeli nde: «Bunuubu Pfumu, a haswaha ndulu miilu, ka swaha napa myoho na mutswe.» <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yisu abweleele: «Muutu wu miiyobo mamba a hali na nzala ubweyobo nyutu yoosi ve. Peleve uswaha miilu, mu tooni ati nde li wu atsyeme woosi. Benu lili baa laatsyeme, ka a benu boosi ve.» <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yisu aba ayaaba ti Yuda usumbasa nde. Ni mu buuna nde haleeli ti: «Benu lili baa laatsyeme, ka a benu boosi ve.»<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Bu nde hamani uswaha bo miilu, Yisu abwevolo muroopo a nde, abwefutaha ŋa metse, na aleeli bo: «Benu limiitsikaha ma me miitsiila benu? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Benu libaateele me “Mulongisi” na “Pfumu”, na benu lili na mbiinga, mu tooni ati buuna ni bu me ndi. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Ni mu buuna, tso me wu ndi Pfumu na Mulongisi a benu, me miitswaha benu miilu, benu kaka lafwana uswahasana miilu. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Me miimweese benu ifwaani, mana benu kaka lisa we bu me tsiidi mu benu. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Eye, me ndeele benu, ni mbuli: musalili a hubaalutala pfumu a nde ve. Na bumosi kaka, iluumbi a hyalutala wu miitsindaha nde ve. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Bunuubu, benu limiiyaaba lo, benu sa liba mu kinya tso benu lisalili lo.»<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />«Me a handi mu undeele mu benu boosi ve. Me nzaabi ba me atsoolo. Ka hwafwana ti Mabasonehe mu Mabuuku ma Ngidi matswiha: “Wu akakabasana lipa na me, amiikinguhala me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:10">Mkg 41.10</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Me mbaandiha uleele benu lo, bu dyaambu kini a laavangimi ve, mana ŋa lo luuvagama, benu lisa imiinu ti “me, me ndi”. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Eye, me ndeele benu lo, ni mbuli: Pasi muutu wu uyaka wu me utsindaha, ni me nde ayaki; na pasi muutu wu uyaka me, yaki kaka wu atsindaha me.»<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu uyabisa ti Yuda usumbasa nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Ŋa yulu a mambu mo maana, Yisu amoni lingebe li lilahi, na ayabisi paayalala: «Eye, me ndeele benu, ni mbuli, mumosi mu benu sa asumbasa me.» <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Bayihi baatalisini, hwavele uyaaba mu na nde hakaleele maana. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Mumosi mu bayihi, wu Yisu haba hatondo, aba atsahala ŋa pedu a Yisu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simoni Peetelo avesi nde mu buyedi, mu ufuula Yisu, mu na nde hakatoyo. <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Buuna, muyihi mo wuuna abaandimi ŋa tulu a Yisu na afuuli nde: «Pfumu, na wuuna?» <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yisu afutili: «Me tsa tuba itini hi lipa hutso a byudya. Wu me upa hyo, ni nde wuuna.» Na Yisu avoli itini hi lipa, atubi hyo hutso a byudya, na aviidi hyo Yuda, mwaana a Simoni Isikariyoti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Bu Yuda havoli itini hi lipa, Saatana akoti mu nde. Yisu aleeli nde: «Mambu ma we li na mo mu uvanga, vanga mo mawasa!» <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Muutu tso mumosi mu ba baaba ŋa metse, a hatsikihi mu hima nde hakaleele nde buuna ve. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Bu Yuda haba ikanga-koome hya mbongo, ba banzuhisini baatsimi ti Yisu nde hakatuma mu uyasuumba bi bo baakisalila mu mukungi, buuve mu uyakabila mbongo huli biyaha. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Yuda avoli itini hi lipa, na apali mu mawasa. Aba aka butsuhu.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miiva mukele wu munyatihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Bu Yuda hapali, Yisu aleeli: «Bunuubu muyusu a Mwana a Muutu miimonehele, na muyusu a Nzambi li mu umonehele mu nde. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />[Na tso muyusu a Nzambi li mu umonehele mu Mwana,] Nzambi mu nde mwakulu kaka, sa ayusa Mwana a nde. Nde sa atswihasa lo mu mawasa. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Baana ba me, me ndi na benu ndulu mu mwaana a taangu hoole, humbisa benu luuyehele usaha me. Ka me ndi mu undeele benu ma me andeeli huli bakuutu ba Bayudaayo: benu a luutwala uyene hu me ndi mu unzyene ve. <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Me miipa benu mukele wu munyatihi: tondosonwani. Benu lafwana utondosono, we bu me atondi benu. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Tso benu libaatondosono, buuna boosi sa bayaaba ti benu lili bayihi ba me.»<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu uyabisa ti Peetelo sa atunala nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoni Peetelo afuuli nde: «Pfumu, we huni li mu uyene?» Yisu afutili nde: «We a hutwala uduukala me hu me ndi mu unzyene ve. Ka we sa duukala me mu matangu ma hubusu.» <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Peetelo aleeli nde: «Pfumu, mu hima me upelendukala we mawasa ma? Me wu apangama ndi, mu ukwa mu tooni a we!» <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yisu afutili nde: «We amiivangama mu ukwa mu tooni a me? Ka nyaha me ndeele we, mu mbuli: tswamina tsusu akohele, we sa utunala me tunala tatu.»<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu ni nzila yi yibaabita huli Taata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yisu aleeli bo: «A liba mitima helini-helini ve. Saani imiinu mu Nzambi, saani kaka imiinu mu me. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Mambuha mali ma maasalila mu nzo a Taata a me. Me tsa nzyene mu ayavangila benu mambuha. Tso a buuna ve, me a hakinzabisa benu lo ve. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Na tso me nzyeni hu uyavangila benu mbuha, me tsanzapfutaha. Me tsapolo benu, mana hu me umba, benu kaka liba huuna. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Na hu me ndi mu unzyene, benu liyaabi nzila.»<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomasi aleeli nde: «Pfumu, bisu a liyaabi hu we li mu uyene ve. Buni bisu luuyaaba nzila?» <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yisu afutili nde: «Me ni nzila, imbuli na moonyi. Muutu tso mumosi a huya huli Taata hwavele uvyohele mu me ve. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Tso benu liyaabi me, benu likiiyaaba kaka Taata a me. Na bunuubu, benu limiiyaaba nde na limiimono nde.»<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipo aleeli nde: «Pfumu, mweese bisu Taata, na buuna bukuhi mu bisu.» <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yisu aleeli nde: «Me ndi na benu umata beleve. We a hayaaba me ve, Filipo? Woosi wu miimono me, miimono Taata. Buni we utwala uleele: “Mweese bisu Taata”? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />We afwana usa imiinu ti me ndi mu Taata, na ti Taata li mu me. Mambu ma me ndi mu undeele, a mali mu umata huli me ve. Ka Taata wu li mu me, ni wu li mu ukuhasa mavaanga ma nde. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Saani me imiinu, ŋa me ndi mu undeele ti: me ndi mu Taata, na Taata li mu me. Tso a buuna ve, saani imiinu mu tooni mavaanga ma me ndi mu utsa.»<verse eid="JHN 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />«Mu mbuli, mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, woosi wu usa imiinu mu me, nde kaka sa akuhasa mavaanga ma me ndi mu utsa. Na nde sa akuhasa ma maalutala bunene, mu tooni ati me ndi mu unzyene huli Taata. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Na byosi bi benu luuvondo mu nduhi a me, me tsa paanga byo, mana muyusu Taata amonehele mu Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Tso benu livondi pasi isiha mu nduhi a me, me tsa paanga hyo.»<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miisa nzuhisini li utsindaha Livupu la Ngidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />«Tso benu latondo me, benu luusingala matumili ma me. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Me tsa pondo Taata mu uva benu mukaliini mukima, wu ukumbasa na uba na benu mu bilima na bilima. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Mukaliini ni Livupu li imbuli. Livupu li baatu ba tsi buuveletwala uyaka. Mu tooni ati, bo utwala umono tso uyaba lo ve. Ka uto ti benu, benu liyabi lo. Mu tooni ati lo lili ŋa hati la benu, na lo sa likwilala mu benu. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Me a hutsiisa benu we bitsaana ve, ka me tsa nza huli benu. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Mu mwaana a taangu hoole, baatu ba tsi a bubwemono me ve. Ka benu, benu sa limono me. Mu tooni ati me ndi moonyi, na benu kaka sa liba moonyi. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Mu ilumbu mo hiina, benu sa liyaba ti me ndi mu Taata a me. Benu lili mu me, na me ndi mu benu. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Muutu wu li mu uyaka matumili ma me, na wu li mu usiingala mo, ni nde wuuna wu atondo me. Muutu wu atondo me, Taata a me sa atondo nde. Me kaka tsa tondo nde, na me tsa monehele na nde.»<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Yuda, a Yuda Isikariyoti ve, afuuli Yisu: «Pfumu, mu hima we umonehele ndulu na bisu na uvelemonehele na baatu boosi?» <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yisu afutili nde bunuubu: «Tso muutu tondi me, nde akeelese mikuma mya me, na Taata a me sa atondo nde. Bisu sa liya huli nde, na bisu sa livaanga nzo a bisu huli nde. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Muutu wu aveletondo me, a hubaasiingala mikuma mya me ve. Na mikuma mi benu lili mu uyuha a mili mu umata huli me ve. Ka myo mili mu umata huli Taata wu atsindaha me.»<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />«Me miinzabisa benu mo bu me kini na benu. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Ka mukaliini, Livupu la Ngidi li Taata hutsindaha mu nduhi a me, luulongese benu mu bisiha byosi. Lo luusa ti benu liyibwala moonyi, mu moosi ma me andeele benu.»<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />«Me ndi mu utsiisa benu hyenze. Ni hyenze hya me, me ndi mu upa benu. Me a handi mu upa benu hyo, we bu baatu ba tsi bubaava ve. Nyaha mitima mya benu mivelehelene, na a liba na boomo ve. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Benu limiiyuha me mu uleele bu: “Me ka dwe, ka me tsa nzapfutaha huli benu.” Tso benu laatondo me, baani mu kinya bu benu limiiyuha ti me aka mu unzyene huli Taata. Mu tooni ati, Taata akulala me. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Me miinzabisa benu misamu mo minimi mu taangu mo yiniiyi, tswamina myo mu uvangama, mana bu myo myuvangama, benu lisiila me imiinu. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Me a hatsaali na taangu yindahi yi ubwetoyo na benu ve. Mu tooni ati, pfumu a toto aka mu uya. Nde a hali na matwala ŋa yulu a me ve. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Ka baatu ba tsi bafwana mu uyaba ti me atondo Taata, na ti me ndi mu ukuhasa we bu Taata hatuma me. Telemaani, limataani ŋaniiŋa!»<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu ni muti a vinye wa mbuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />«Me, me ni muti a vinye<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:1-4">Esa 5.1-4</ref></char></note> wa mbuli na Taata a me ni musali a ngundu. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Pasi itabi hi hyakangama mu me na hi hyavele na mbutu, Taata ubaatsakula hyo. Na pasi itabi hi hili na mbutu, nde ubaatsyemese hyo, mana hyo hibwefulala ubuta mbutu. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Ka benu, benu laamiitsyeme mu tooni a mikuma mi me anzabisa benu. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Kangamaani mu me, we bu me akangama mu benu. Itabi hi muti a vinye utwala ubuta mbutu mu hyo mwakulu ve, tso hyo a hyakangama na muti a vinye ve. Ni bumosi kaka, benu utwala ubuta mbutu, tso benu a laakangama mu me ve.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />Me ni muti a vinye, benu lili bitabi. Muutu wu akangama mu me, na wu me akangama mu nde, ubaabuta mbutu yindahi, mu tooni ati me uvele, benu utwala usa pasi isiha ve. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Ka muutu avelekangama mu me, sa babwaha nde hu mbadi we itabi hi muti, na humbisa hyo hibaakanya. Bu bamiimana utolo bitabi bi byakanya, bubaabwaha byo hu mbaahu na byo bibaanyenge. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Tso benu likwilili mu me, na mambu ma me makwilili mu benu, vondwaani pasi hi benu litondi, benu sa libaha hyo. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Ŋa benu luubuta mbutu yindahi, na ŋa benu luumonehele bayihi ba me, ni ŋaana muyusu a Taata a me humonehele.»<verse eid="JHN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />«We bu Taata hatondo me, me kaka atondo benu. Kwilalaani mutso litondo la me. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Bu me atsiingili matumili ma Taata a me, me ndi mu ukwilala hutso litondo la nde. Bumosi kaka, benu lisiingala matumili ma me, benu sa likwilala hutso litondo la me.»<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />«Me miindeele benu mambu mo maana, mana kinya a me yiba mu benu, na kinya a benu yiba yi yasupahana<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:2">Esa 9.2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 35:10">35.10</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Mukele a me ni wunuuwu: tondosonwani we bu me atondo benu. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Litondo li laalutala, ni ukwa mu tooni bambaahi. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Benu lili bambaahi ba me, tso benu lili mu usa ma me ndi mu utuma benu. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Me a handi mu umbweteele benu basalili ve. Mu tooni ati musalili a hubaayaaba ma pfumu a nde ubaasa ve. Ka me ndi mu uteele benu bambaahi, mu tooni ati me unzabisa benu moosi ma me anziha huli Taata a me. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />A benu laasoolo me ve, ka me ni wu asoolo benu. Me miipa benu tumili mo yiniiyi: yenaani, butaani mbutu yi yukwilala. Buuna, pasi hi benu luuvondo huli Taata mu nduhi a me, nde sa ava benu hyo. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Dyambu li me ndi mu utuma benu, ni utondosono.»<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baatu ba tsi baabelele bayihi ba Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />«Tso baatu ba tsi baabelele benu, yaabaani ti bo baatswamini ubelele me. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Tso benu laakiiba baatu ba tsi mo yiniiyi, tsi yakiitondo bi bili mu yo. Ka benu a lili baatu ba tsi ve. Me atsoolo benu ŋa hati la baatu ba tsi, ni mu tooni mo yiina baatu ba tsi baabelele benu. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Yibwalaani moonyi mu mikuma mi me andeeli benu: “Musalili a hubaalutala pfumu a nde ve.” Tso baatsuti me, bo sa batsuta benu kaka. Tso baakeelisi mikuma mya me, bo sa bakeelese mikuma mya benu kaka. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Ka bo busiila benu mavaanga ma mabi maana moosi mu tooni a me. Mu tooni ati, bo a baayaba wu atsindaha me ve. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Tso me a hanzidi ve, na tso me a handongisi bo ve, bo a baakibaha masumu ve. Ka bunuubu, bo utwala utuna masumu ma bo ve. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Muutu wu li iboho na me, nde li kaka iboho na Taata a me. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Tso me a hatsiidi bipadi ŋa hati la bo ve, bipadi bi muutu mukima havelesa, bo a baakibaha masumu ve. Ka bunuubu, bo baamiimono byo, na bo baamiibelele me na Taata a me. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Dyambu mo linili limiivangama, mana Mabasonehe mu Mikele mya bo, matswiha: “Bo baabelili me hwavele a tooni<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Mkg 35.19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:5">69.5</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />«Me utsindaha benu Mukaliini wu umata huli Taata. Ni Livupu li luumata huli Taata, li luumweese imbuli. Ŋa nde huya, nde utiila me imbangi. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Benu kaka, sa litiila me imbangi, mu tooni ati benu lili na me umata mbandu.»<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />«Me miinzabisa benu mambu mo maana, mana benu livelebwisa imiinu hya benu. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Bo sa bapalisa benu mu manzo ma lisambulu li Bayudaayo. Na taangu yili mu uya, yi bo buutsima ti, tso bo badubi benu, yiina ni nzila huli bo yi ukuunda Nzambi. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Bo buusa buuna, mu tooni ati, bo a bayaba tso Taata, tso me ve. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Ka me miinzabisa benu mo, mana bu taangu yuuto, benu liyibwala moonyi ti me anzabisi benu mo.»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 16:4">Isalu hi Livupu la Ngidi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">«Tso me a handeeli benu mo hu mbandu ve, mu tooni ati me ambeedi kini na benu. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Bunuubu, me ka mu unzyene huli wu atsindaha me. Ka a hu li na muutu tso mumosi mu benu wu ufuula me ve: “We huni li mu uyene?” <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Ka mu tooni ati me miinzabisa benu mambu mo maana, lingebe limiiluula benu mu mitima. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Bunuubu, mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, hwafwana huli benu, me mu uyene. Mu tooni ati, me upelenzyene, Mukaliini a huya huli benu ve. Ka tso me nzyeni, me tsa tsindaha benu nde. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Na bu nde huya, nde sa ayalusa mitima mya baatu ba tsi mo yiniiyi, ba baamiidunga mu dyaambu li masumu, li butsiitsa na la tsundusu a Nzambi. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Bo baamiidunga mu li litali masumu, mu tooni ati baatu a bali mu usiila me imiinu ve. <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Bo baamiidunga mu li litali butsiitsa, mu tooni ati me ka mu unzyene huli Taata, na benu a lubwemono me ve. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Bo baamiidunga mu li litali tsundusu, mu tooni ati Nzambi amiitehele utsundasa pfumu a tsi mo yiniiyi.»<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />«Me kini na mambu ma malahi ma uyabisa benu, ka benu a lutwala ukuunda mo mu taangu mo yiniiyi ve. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Ka bu nde huya, nde, Livupu li libaayabisa imbuli, nde sa abita benu mu imbuli hyoosi. Nde a huyambila mu nde mwakulu ve. Ka nde sa aleele moosi ma nde huyuha na uyabisa benu mambu ma muuya hu busu. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Nde umweese muyusu a me, mu tooni ati nde uyaka mambu ma me, na uyabisa benu mo. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Byosi bi Taata a li na byo, bili bya me. Ni mu buuna me ndeeli ti, Livupu sa liyaka mambu ma me na uyabisa benu mo.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />Mwana a taangu hoole yimiisaala, na benu a lubwemono me ve. Na titswene, mwaana a taangu hoole, benu sa libwemono me<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mabuuku ma mwakulu makima mali mu ubwese mambu mo maniima: «Mu tooni ati, me huli Taata me ndi mu unzyene.» </char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Ni mu buuna, bakima ŋa hati li bayihi baakalelesene: «Nde hima ali mu uleele bisu? Nde li mu uleele: “Mwana a taangu hoole yimiisaala, na benu a lubwemono me ve. Na titswene, mwaana taangu hoole, benu sa libwemono me.” Na nde bubwese bunuubu: “Me huli Taata me ndi mu unzyene.”» <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Bo baakafulasana: «Nde ŋa hima atoondi uleele, “Mwana a taangu hoole”? Bisu a laatsikaha ma nde ali mu uleele ve.»<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Bu Yisu hayaabi ti bo baaba na nzala uva nde hyuhu, nde aleeli: «Benu laaka mu ufulasana, mu uyaba mu ma me ndeeli hima matondi uleele: “Mwana a taangu hoole yimiisaala, na benu a lubwemono me ve. Titswene, mwaana a taangu hoole, benu sa libwemono me.” <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Mu mbuli, mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, benu sa lilila na benu sa likoto mu minyongo, ka baatu ba tsi sa baba mu kinya. Benu sa likoto mu lingebe, ka lingebe la benu sa lisobohono mu kinya. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Bu mukaasu aka na misoongo, mutima a nde ubaaba mu lingebe. Mu tooni ati ya nde taangu yi mapasi yimiito. Ka bu nde amiimana ubuta mwaana, nde a hubaabweyibwala moonyi mu mapasi ve, mu tooni a kinya a mwaana wu nde amiibuta. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Bunuubu, benu kaka lili na lingebe. Ka me tsa mbwemono benu, na mutima a benu sa abweba mu kinya. A hu li na tso muutu wu utwala umaasa benu kinya mo yiina ve.»<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />«Mu ilumbu mo hiina, benu a luubweva me hyuhu mu pasi dyaambu ve. Mu mbuli, mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, hi benu luvondo huli Taata, nde sa ava benu hyo mu nduhi a me. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Natee bunuunbu, benu a laavondo pasi isiha mu nduhi a me ve. Vondwaani na benu sa liyaka, mana kinya benu yiba yi yasupahana.»<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibingala tsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />«Me miinzabisa benu mambu mo maana mu makuma. Tangu sa yiya yi me umbwepeletoyo na benu mu makuma. Ka ni taangu yi me unzabisa benu paayalala, ma mali mu utala Taata. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Mu ilumbu mo hiina, benu sa livondo mu nduhi a me. Me a handi mu ndeele benu ve ti me tsa tsambila Taata mu tooni a benu, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />mu tooni ati Taata nde mwakulu atondo benu. Nde hatondo benu bu benu laatondo me, na mu tooni ati benu laasa imiinu ti me huli Taata amata. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Me mu Taata apala, na me anza mu tsi. Bunuubu me ka mu umata ŋa tsi na me ka mu upfutaha huli Taata.» <verse eid="JHN 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Bayihi ba nde baaleeli nde: «We ka mu uyambila paayalala hwavele makuma. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Bunuubu bisu limiitsikaha ti we ayaaba mambu moosi, na we a hali na nzala ti muutu ava we hyuhu ve. Ni mu buuna, bisu limiisa imiinu ti we mu Nzambi apala.»<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yisu afutili bo: «Bunuubu benu limiisiila me imiinu? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Tangu yika mu uto, na yo yaamiito, yi benu lupambuha muutu muutu ya nde tsyelo, na yi benu lusiisa me siha vii. Ka me a handi siha ve, mu tooni ati Taata na me ali. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Me miinzabisa benu mambu mo maana, mana benu likangama mu me, benu libaha hyenze. Benu sa libwana mbingisili ŋa tsi. Ka baani na ibahala! Me amimbingala tsi!»<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu usambila mu bayihi ba nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Nde amana utoyo buuna, Yisu asimbuli miisu hu yulu na aleeli: «Taata, taangu yimiito. Yusa Mwana a we, mana Mwana a we kaka ayusa we! <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />We aviidi nde lituma ŋa yulu a baatu boosi, mana nde ava moonyi wu bilima na bilima huli boosi ba we ava nde. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Ka moonyi wu bilima na bilima ni uyaaba we Nzambi, wu li Nzambi ndulu mosi wa mbuli, na uyaaba wu we atsindihi, Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Me minzuusa we ŋa toto, mu tooni ati, me miimana isalu hi we atuma me usa. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Bunuubu, Taata, yusa me ŋa busu bwa we. Yusa me mu biyusili bi me amba na byo ŋa pedu a we, tswamina pangili a toto. <verse eid="JHN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />Me anzabisi nduhi a we huli baatu ba we apalisi mu tsi, ba we aviidi me. We abahi bo, ka we ava me bo, na bo baasingili mikuma mya we. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Bunuubu, bo bamiitsikaha ti byosi bi we ava me, huli we byamata. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Mu tooni ati, me apa bo mambu ma we ava me. Bo baayaka mo, bo baayaba ti mu mbuli me mu we apala. Na bo baasa imiinu ti we ni wu atsindaha me. <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Ni mu tooni a bo, me ndi mu utsambila we. Me a handi mu utsambila mu baatu ba tsi ve, ka mu ba we ava me, bu bo bali ba we abaha. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Baatu boosi ba me ndi na bo, bali ba we. Na boosi ba we bali ba me. Na muyusu a me li mu umonehele mu bo. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Mwana taangu hoole, me a humbwemba mu tsi ve, me upfutaha huli we Taata. Ka uto ti bo, bo bali ba tsi. We wu li wa ngidi, keelese bo itwadi na we, we wu li itwadi na me. Mana bo baba muutu mumosi, we bu we na me lili muutu mumosi. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Ŋa me mbeedi na bo, me akeelisi itwadi hya bo na we, we wu li itwadi na me. Me akalana bo, na tso muutu mumosi mu bo a hanyambana ve, vengo muutu mumosi wu baanenge mu unyambana, mana Mabasonehe mu Mabuuku ma Ngidi matswiha<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:10">Mkg 41.10</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Na bunuubu, me ka mu unza huli we, na me ndi mu unzabisa mambu mo maniima bu me kini ŋa tsi. Me ndi mu unzabisa mo, mana bo baba na kinya yi yili na me, ni kinya yi yasupahana. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Me apa bo mikuma mya we, na baatu ba tsi na piinga mu bo. Mu tooni ati, bo a bali ba tsi ve, we bu me avele wa tsi mo yiniiyi. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Me a handi mu upondo huli we mu umaasa bo mu tsi ve, ka mu ukeelese bo ŋa busu bu mubungi. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Bo a bali ba tsi ve, we bu me avele wa tsi.»<verse eid="JHN 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />«Mambu ma we ni imbuli, tsyemese bo mu imbuli hya we. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />We bu we atsindihi me mu tsi, me kaka miitsindaha bo mu tsi. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Na me, me ndi mu utsyeme me mwakulu mu bo, mana bo kaka baba ba baatsyeme mu imbuli. <verse eid="JHN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />Me a handi mu utsambila we ndulu mu bo ve, ka napa mu ba buusiila me imiinu mu ma bo buuleele mu me. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Me ndi mu utsambila, mana boosi baba we muutu mumosi. Taata, nyaha bo baba itwadi mu we na me, we bu we li itwadi na me, na me ndi itwadi na we. Nyaha bo baba muutu mumosi, mana baatu ba tsi basa imiinu ti ni we atsindaha me. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Na me miipa bo muyusu wu we aviidi me, mana bo baba muutu mumosi, we bu we na me lili muutu mumosi. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Me ndi moonyi mu bo, na we li moonyi mu me. Buuna, bo buuba muutu mumosi we bu hwafwana, mana baatu ba tsi bayaaba ti we atsindaha me, na ti we atondo bayihi ba me we bu we atondo me.»<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />«Taata, me tondi ti baatu ba we ava me, baba na me ŋa me umba. Me tondi ti bo bamono muyusu a me. Ni muyusu wu we ava me, mu tooni ati, we atondo me tswamina pangili a tsi. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Taata Nga Butsiitsa, baatu ba tsi a bayaaba we ve. Ka me, me anzaaba we, na bayihi ba me bamiisilasa ti we ni wu atsindaha me. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Me anzabisa bo nduhi a we, na me tsa mbwenzabisa bo yo, mana litondo li we atondo me liba mu bo, na me mba me mwakulu mu bo.»<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Masadaadu mamiikanga Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Bu nde hamani uleele buuna, Yisu na bayihi ba nde baayeni na baasabuhi hu simu lina la mbeenge a Sederoni. Huuna hwaba na ngundu miti mosi hu Yisu hakoti na bayihi ba nde. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yuda, wu akuti mu usumbasa Yisu, aba ayaaba mbuha mo yiina. Mu tooni ati, Yisu na bayihi ba nde baaba na ipfu hi ubaapfutana huuna. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Ni mu buuna, Yuda habiti kabu li balwani, na bakeelisi, ba bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na Bafarisi baatsindihi, na ayeni na bo hu ngundu miti. Bo baaba na bilwanili, na miinda, na minyangi.<verse eid="JHN 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Bu Yisu haba hayaaba moosi ma maakayiila nde, nde ayidi na aleeli bo: «Na benu lili mu usaha?» <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Bo bafutili: «Yisu, musi Nazareti.» Yisu ni uleele bo: «Me ndyowunuuwu!» Yuda wu akasumbasa nde ni ŋaana haba na bo. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Ŋa Yisu haleeli bo ti: «Me ndyowunuuwu», bo baafutihi mambimbisa, na baabwiidi ŋa toto. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yisu abwefuula bo: «Na benu lili mu usaha?» Bo baafutili: «Yisu musi Nazareti.» <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yisu afutili bo: «Me ndeeli benu ti “me ndyowunuuwu.” Tso ni me benu lili mu usaha, nyahaani bana bayene.»<verse eid="JHN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Aba mu tooni ukuhasa mikuma mi nde haleeli: «Me a hanyambasana muutu tso mumosi mu ba we ava me ve.» <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simoni Peetelo wu aba na sabila apalisi nde, na ateti musalili a mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi, na akesi nde tswi la mbahala. Nduhi musalili mo wuuna aba Malakusi. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Ka Yisu ni uleele Peetelo: «Futala sabila a we hutso isupu hya nde. We li mu utsima ti me a hunywa mbuungu yi mapasi, yi Taata hamiivangimasa mu me ve?»<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Kabu li balwani na mukuutu a lo, na bakeedi baa Bayudaayo, baakangi Yisu na baahadi nde mikudu mu myoho.<verse eid="JHN 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Bo baamabita nde huli Ane, wu aba buko bwa Kayifa. Kayifa aba mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi mu ilima mo hiina. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Ka Kayifa ni wu aviidi ndoongi mo yiniiyi huli bakuutu ba Bayudaayo: «Hu li bubwe ti muutu mumosi kwidi ŋa mbuha a buli.»<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peetelo miitunala Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoni Peetelo na muyihi mukima baakaduukala Yisu. Muyihi mukima wuuna, aba ayabaana na mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi watsomi. Ni mu buuna, nde hakoti nzila mosi na Yisu hutso litandala la nzo mukuutu mo. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Ka Peetelo asaali humbadi litandala, bebele na ikotili. Muyihi wu aba ayabaana na mukuutu mo, apali na atoyi na mukaasu wu akakeelese ikotili. Titswene, nde atumisi ukotese Peetelo. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Buuna, mukaasu wu abakeedi ikotili afuuli Peetelo: «We kaka a hali mumosi mu bayihi ba bahala mo linili ve?» Nde aleeli: «Naana, a me ve!»<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Basalili na bakeedi ba baaba ŋaana, baaduuki mbaahu mu makala, yi bo baakayoto mu tooni a piyu. Peetelo kaka aba na bo na akayoto mbaahu.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi watsomi afuuli Yisu mu bayihi ba nde, na mu ndongisili a nde. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yisu afutili nde: «Me akatoyo paayalala huli baatu boosi. Me akandongese taangu yoosi mu manzo ma lisambulu li Bayudaayo, na mu nzo a Nzambi hu Bayudaayo boosi bubaapfutana. Me a handeele pasi dyaambu mu tswehi ve. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Mu hima we li mu uva me hyuhu mo hiina? Fuula boosi ba baayuha ma me anzabisa bo. Bo bayaabi moosi ma me andeele.» <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Yisu amana uleele buuna, mumosi mu bakeedi ba baaba ŋaana, ateti nde lipali na aleeli: «Buuna ni bu hwafwana mu ufutala mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi?» <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yisu afutili nde: «Tso me miitoyo bubi, mweese ti ma me miindeele a mafwana ve. Na tso me miitoyo bubwe, mu hima we miitete me?» <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Na Ane atsindihi nde wu bahada mikudu, huli Kayifa mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Simoni Peetelo aba ŋa litandala ŋaana mu uyoto mbaahu. Baafuuli nde bunuubu: «We kaka, we a hali mumosi mu bayihi ba nde ve?» Nde atuni na aleeli: «A me ve.» <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Mumosi mu basalili ba mukuutu, ikuta hya wu Peetelo hakesi tswi, aleeli: «Me a hamoni we na nde hutso a ngundu miti ve?» <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Peetelo abwetunala nde. Na mu mawasa, tsusu akohili.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu bamiibita ŋa busu bwa Pilaato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Bamata hu nzo a Kayifa, bo baabiti Yisu hu nzo mutumi ŋa hati a ngwali. Ba baabiti nde, a baakoti mu nzo ve, mu uvelesumaha na mu tooni udya Paake. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Ni mu buuna, mutumi Pilaato hasusihi hupedu a bo humbadi. Nde afuuli bo: «Mu ki dyaambu benu lili mu ukese bahala mo linili?» <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Bo baafutili nde: «Tso nde a hali muvaangi a mambu ma mabi ve, bisu a likiibehele we nde ve.» <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Ŋa yulu a ŋaana, Pilaato aleeli bo: «Benu mwakulu, volwaani nde na tsundasaani nde we bu hu li Mikele mya benu.» Bayudaayo baafutili nde: «Bisu a lili na muswa mu uduba muutu ve.»<verse eid="JHN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Aba mu ukuhasa ma Yisu haleeli, bu nde halahi mu ki pila lipfu nde hukwila. <verse eid="JHN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Pilaato akoti mu nzo a nde, ateeli Yisu na afuuli nde: «We ni mutumi Bayudaayo?» <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yisu afutili: «We mu we mwakulu leeli lo, vo ti bu bakima baaleeli we lo mu tooni a me?» <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilaato ni ufutala nde: «Me kaka Muyudaayo ndi? Baatu ba tsi a we, na bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi bamiiyasumbasa we huli me. We ki dyaambu asa?» <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yisu ni ufutala: «Ipfumu hya me a hili hya tsi mo yiniiyi ve. Tso ipfumu hya me hikiiba hya tsi mo yiniiyi, kini basalili ba me bamiikalana me, mana bavelevahula me huli bakuutu ba Bayudaayo. Ka a buuna ve, ipfumu hya me a hili hya tsi mo yiniiyi ve.» <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Pilaato aleeli nde: «We mutumi we li?» Yisu afutili: «Ni we li mu uleele ti me “mutumi” ndi. Ka baabuta me, na ni me anza ŋa tsi mu utiila imbangi imbuli. Muutu wu abaambana na imbuli, ubaayuha ma me ndi mu undeele.» <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilaato afuuli nde: «Imbuli ni hima?»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JHN 18:38">Yisu kondaayi lipfu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Pilaato amana uleele buuna, nde ayeni huli Bayudaayo na nde aleeli bo: «Me a handi mu umono dyaambu tso limosi li ukotese nde ikondaayi ve. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Ka benu na ipfu hya ti, pasi mukungi a Paake me ukaanyahula benu kondaayi mumosi. Benu litondi ti me nyahula benu mutumi Bayudaayo?» <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Na bo baabwefulaha: «Naana, a nde ve! Nyahula bisu Barabasi!» Kaahu Barabasi aba mutaani.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Buuna Pilaato atumi mu ubita Yisu, na mu ufwinza nde bikooti. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Masadaadu maatungi mutata wu matsyende. Mo maasuusi nde ŋa yulu mutswe a Yisu na maalwatisi nde libita li libenge. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Titswene bo baakayasusaha ŋa pedu a nde na ubaaleele: «Bwehe, mutumi Bayudaayo!» Na bo baakatete nde mapali. <verse eid="JHN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilaato abwepala hu mbadi, na aleeli huli Bayudaayo: «Monwaani, me ka mu umbehele benu nde hu mbadi, mana benu liyaaba ti me a hamono pasi dyaambu li utsundasa nde ve.» <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Titswene, Yisu apali hu mbadi na mutata matsyende ŋa yulu mutswe, na libita li libenge mu nyutu. Na Pilaato aleeli bo: «Monwaani muutu mo ndyowunuuwu!» <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Bu bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na bakeedi baamoni nde, bo baafulihi: «Komene nde ŋa muti! Komene nde ŋa muti!» Pilaato aleeli bo: «Volwaani na komenaani nde benu mwakulu ŋa muti. Me a handi mu umono dyaambu li utsundasa nde ve.» <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Bayudaayo, baafutili nde: «Bisu lili na Mikele, na Mukele mumosi ubaaleele ti, nde afwana mu ukwa. Mu tooni ati, nde miibilumana “Mwana a Nzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lev 24.16</ref> </char></note>”.»<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Bu Pilaato hayuhi mambu mo maana, boomo bwa nde bwafulili. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Nde akoti hu nzo a tsundusu na nde afuuli Yisu: «We huni amata?» Ka Yisu a hafutili nde mvutu ve. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Buuna, Pilaato ni uleele nde: «We bisi ufutala me mvutu? We yaabi ti, me ndi na matwala ma unyahula we, na ma ukomene we ŋa muti.» <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yisu afutili: «We a hakiiba na matwala mu me ve, tso mo a mamati huli Nzambi ve. Ni mu buuna, wu yehuli me huli we, bahi tooni yi lisumu lilinene hwafulala we.»<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Umata taangu mo yiina, Pilaato akasaha unyahula Yisu. Ka Bayudaayo baakafulaha: «We unyahula nde, we a hali mbaahi a mutumi Kayisaali ve. Pasi muutu wu ubaabilumana pfumu a tsi, li muboho a Kayisaali.» <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Bu Pilaato hayuhi mambu mo maana, nde abiti Yisu hu mbadi, na atsahili ŋa itsiha hi mutsundisi, ŋa mbuha yi bubaateele: «Mbuha yi baayala Mamanya», mu Ibeleho ubaateele «Ngabata». <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Aba ilumbu hi hyakatehele pangimisi mukungi a Paake, hupedu a mwangulu. Pilaato aleeli huli Bayudaayo: «Pfumu a benu, ndyowunuuwu!» <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Na baabwi mu ufulaha: «Duba! Duba! Komene nde ŋa muti!» Pilaato afuuli bo: «Me komene pfumu a benu?» Bakuutu ba bangaanga baa Nzambi ba baafutili: «Bisu a lili na pfumu mukima ve, ŋa yulu a mutumi Kayisaali.» <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Bunuubu, Pilaato ayehuli bo Yisu, mana bayakomene nde ŋa muti.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu bamiikomene ŋa muti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Yisu abiti muti a kuruwa nde mwakulu na apali mu musyenge, mu uyene hu mbuha yi bubaateele: «Mbuha yi Ibanga», mu Ibeleho: «Ngolongota». <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Ni huuna, bo baakomini Yisu ŋa muti na baatu boole bakima, ba baakomini mu bakuruwa ba bo. Mumosi baakomini hu mbahala, na wuna hu kaasu na Yisu ŋa hahati. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilaato atumi ubaandiha baya ŋa kuruwa a Yisu. Baya li baaba baasonehe bunuubu: «Yisu musi Nazareti, Mutumi Bayudaayo.» <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Bayudaayo ba banzuhisini baataangi bisono mo biina, mu tooni ati mbuha yi baakomini Yisu yaaba ŋa pedu musyenge. Bisono bi baasonihi aba mu ndaha Ibeleho, mu Ingereke na mu Ilatino. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Bangaanga ba Nzambi baatsomi baa Bayudaayo, baaleeli huli Pilaato: «A hasonehe: “Mutumi Bayudaayo”, ka sonehe: “Muutu mo wunuuwu aleeli ti: Me ni Mutumi Bayudaayo.”» <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilaato afutili: «Bi me miitsonehe, me miitsonehe byo nzyeni.»<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Bu masadaadu maamani ukomene Yisu ŋa muti a kuruwa, mo maavoli bikutu bya nde na maasiidi makabu mana, kabu limosi mu pasi lisadaadu. Masadaadu maavoli kaka ikutu hya talu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ikutu hya talu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ikutu hi hyafutana na mubati wu waaba ndulu mu tsanda mosi, hwavele unamiha bibadi bi matsanda makima ma baatungala hyo.</char></note>, hi hyaba mu tsanda mosi, umata hu yulu natee hu tsina. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Masadaadu maalelisini: «linyahaani ukasula hyo, ka litaani hyo ngodo, mu uyaaba na ubaha hyo.» Aba mu tooni ati, Mabasonehe mu Mabuuku ma Ngidi matswiha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">«Bo baakabisini bikutu bya me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">na bo baatidi ikutu hya me ngodo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:19">Mkg 22.19</ref> </char></note>.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Mono mambu ma masadaadu maavaangi.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Ŋa muvanga a muti a kuruwa a Yisu, hwaba hwateleme: bangu ba nde boole, Mariya mukadi a Kolopasi, na Mariya musi Magadala. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yisu amoni ngu a nde na muyihi wu nde hakatondo, ateleme ŋa pedu a nde. Yisu aleeli huli ngu a nde: «Maama, mono mwaana a we.» <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Titswene, nde aleeli huli muyihi a nde: «Mono, ngu a we.» Na umata taangu mo yiina, muyihi avoli Mariya na akatsahala na nde.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lipfu la Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Hu mbisa a mambu mo maana, Yisu aba ayaaba ti moosi mamiikuha. Ka mu tooni a Mabasonehe mu Libuuku la Ngidi mavangama, Yisu aleeli: «Me aka na peyu a mamba<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:22">Mkg 69.22</ref> </char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Hwaba ŋaana na itehili hi hyaba hyaluula mu vinye a nganyi. Masadaadu maabotihi mukamuna mutso a vinye<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:22">Mkg 69.22</ref> </char></note>, bo baakatisi nde mu itini hi muti hya isopi na baayasuusala hyo mu munywa a Yisu. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Bu Yisu habiimbi vinye a nganyi, nde aleeli: «Moosi mamiitswiha!» Titswene, nde abohili likingu na amani muvumu.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Hwaba ilumbu hi hyakatswamina mukungi a Paake. Bo a baatondi unyaha nyutu bamvumbi ŋa yulu bakuruwa mu ilumbu mo hiina ve, mu tooni ati, ilumbu hya Saba mo hiina aba ilumbu hya tsongo. Buuna, batumi baa Bayudaayo baavondi muswa huli Pilaato, mu uboholo miilu mi bavumbi na usutasa nyutu a bo. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Ni mu buuna, masadaadu maayidi mu uboholo miilu mya watsomi wu baakomini itwadi na Yisu, titswene bo baabohili mya waboole. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Ka, bo bayato mu Yisu, bo a baabohili miilu mya nde ve. Mu tooni ati, nde aba amiikwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Lisadaadu limosi laapihi nde kongo mu libanzi. Mu mawasa, makila na mamba byapali mu nyutu a nde. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Muutu wu amoni moosi ma maavyohi, atiidi imbangi na imbangi hya nde hili hya mbuli. Nde yaabi ti, mambu ma nde haleeli ni mbuli. Ka nde haleeli mambu mo maana, mana benu kaka lisa imiinu. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Mambu mo maana maavangimi, mana Mabasonehe mu Libuuku la Ngidi matswiha: «A buboholo visi la nde tso limosi ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Pal 12.46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Mat 9.12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:21">Mkg 34.21</ref> </char></note>.» <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Na tsyelo kima, Libuuku la Ngidi lili mu ubweleele: «Bo sa batala huli wu bo baapihi nde libanzi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zak 12.10</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndihili a Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Humbisa a maana, Yosefi musi Arimate, wu aba muyihi a Yisu, ayavolo nyutu a nde. Nde ayavondo muswa huli Pilaato mu usutasa nyutu a Yisu. Nde asiidi lo mu tswehi, mu tooni a boomo bu Bayudaayo. Pilaato aviidi muswa huli Yosefi mu usutasa mvumbi.<verse eid="JHN 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nikodemo wu ayamono Yisu hutso butsuhu, ayidi kaka na abehi nyafi yi baavanga mu miire na alowesi. Nyafi yaakaleme bebele na bakilu maku-matatu (30).<verse eid="JHN 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Bo baboole baavoli nyutu a Yisu na baapoti yo mu birende bya tsanda ya lino. Baapuhili yo nyafi, we bu hwaba bipfu bya ndihili huli Bayudaayo. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Hwaba na wooto ŋa ibiingi hya mbuha yi baakomini Yisu ŋa muti a kuruwa. Na hutso a wooto aba na ngila yi nyatihi, yi yaaba kini a baadihi muutu ve. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Bu hwaba ilumbu hi hyakatswamina mukungi a Paake, na bu ngila yaba bebele, bo baasusi nyutu a Yisu hutso a ngila mo yiina.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Tsuuhili a Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Mu ilumbu hya Saba ŋa tsumba a ngwali, Mariya musi Magadala ayeni hu ngila. Nde amoni ti manya la ŋa kotili a ngila baamiimasa. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Nde ayeni tiinu mu uyabisala Simoni Peetelo na muyihi wu Yisu haba hatondo. Nde aleeli bo: «Baamiimaasa nyutu a Pfumu mu ngila, na bisu a liyaabi huni baamiiyasusa yo ve.»<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Peetelo na muyihi wuna baayeni hu ngila. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Bo baayeni tiinu bo ba boole. Ka muyihi wuna alutihili Peetelo tiinu, na atswamini uto hu ngila. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Nde abaandimi mu utala na amoni birende bya tsanda a lino bi byaba baasuusa ŋaana, ka nde a hakoti hu hati ve.<verse eid="JHN 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simoni Peetelo wu akaduukala nde ayato. Nde akoti hutso a ngila, nde amoni birende bya tsanda a lino byaba ŋaana, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />na tsanda yi baafungili mutswe a Yisu. Tsanda mo yiniiyi a yaabeedi mbuha mosi na birende ve. Ka baaba baafuta yo ŋa muvanga, ŋa mbuha kima. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Titswene, muyihi wuna, wu atswamini uto hu ngila, akoti nde kaka. Nde amoni na asiidi imiinu. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Mu taangu mo yiina, bayihi baabeedi kini a baatsikihi Libuuku la Ngidi ve. Lo lili mu uleele ti, Yisu aba afwana usuuha mu babaakwa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:10">Mkg 16.10</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Na bayihi ba boole baafutihi hu nzo a bo.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miimonehele huli Mariya musi Magadala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Mu taangu mo yiina, Mariya aba hu mbadi ŋa kotili a ngila, na nde aba mu ulila. Bu nde haaba mu ulila, nde abaandimi mu utala hutso a ngila. <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />Nde amoni bapofi boole balwata bikutu bi bifuuka, baatsahala ŋa mbuha yi baaba baasuusa nyutu a Yisu. Pofi mumosi hu tsyelo mutswe, wuna hu miilu. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Bapofi baafuuli nde: «Maama, mu hima we li mu ulila?» Nde afutili bo: «Mu tooni ati baamiimasa Pfumu a me, na me a hanzaabi huni baayasuusa nyutu a nde ve.»<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Bu nde hakaleele buuna, nde akinguhi, na nde amoni Yisu mu tele, hwavele uyaaba ti ni Yisu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yisu afuuli nde: «Maama, mu hima we li mu ulila? We na li mu usaha?» Bu nde hakatsima ti muutu wu, aba musali a wooto, mukaasu aleeli nde: «Pfumu, tso ni we biti nde, leele me huni we suusi nde, na me nzapolo nde.» <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yisu ni uleele nde: «Mariya!» Nde akinguhi na aleeli nde mu Ibeleho: «Rabuni!» Mbindulili ni ti: «Mulongisi!»<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yisu aleeli nde: «A habembe me! Mu tooni ati me kini a hapaata huli Taata a me ve. Ka yene huli baana ba ngu a me, na leele bo ti, “Me aka mu ukumasa huli Taata a me, wu li kaka Taata a benu. Me aka mu ukumasa huli Nzambi a me, wu li kaka Nzambi a benu.”» <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Mariya musi Magadala ayayabisa huli bayihi: «Me miimono Pfumu!» Na nde ayabisi bo mambu ma Yisu haleeli nde.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miimonehele huli bayihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Tsitsaha a ilumbu mo hiina, ilumbu hi limiingu, bayihi baaba baakuukama mutso a nzo. Bo baaba badibuha minywa mya nzo mu batsaafi, bu bo baaba na boomo bu bakuutu ba Bayudaayo. Yisu ayidi, ayateleme ŋa hati la bo, na aleeli: «Nyaha hyenze hiba na benu!» <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Bu nde hamani uleele buuna, nde amweesi bo myoho mya nde na libanzi la nde. Bayihi baaba mu kinya bu baamoni Pfumu. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yisu abweleele bo: «Nyaha hyenze hiba na benu! We bu Taata a me hatsindaha me, me kaka miitsindaha benu.» <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Titswene nde afuli mupu ŋa yulu a bo na aleeli: «Yakaani Livupu la Ngidi. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Boosi ba benu luunyahula masumu, buuyaka nyahulili masumu. Na boosi ba benu luuvelenyahula masumu, buukanga masumu ma bo.»<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miimonehele huli Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Tomasi, nga kuumbu «Vasa», mumosi mu bayihi kuumi na boole, a haba na bo ŋa Yisu hayidi ve. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Bayihi bakima baayabisi Tomasi: «Bisu limiimono Pfumu.» Ka nde aleeli bo: «Me apfwana umono bikidi bya tsooso mu myoho mya nde, na usuusa mulembo a me ŋa mbuha yi baakomini nde tsooso. Me apfwana kaka usuusa kaka la me mu ikidi hi libanzi la nde. Tso a buuna ve, me a hutsa imiinu ve.»<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Bilumbu tsambu bivyoho, bayihi baabwekuukama mutso a nzo, na Tomasi kaka abeedi ŋaana. Minywa mya nzo myaba baadibuha mu batsaafi. Masulubete, Yisu ayidi, ayateleme ŋa hati la bo na aleeli: « Nyaha hyenze hiba na benu!» <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Titswene, nde aleeli Tomasi: «Suusa mulembo a we ŋaniiŋa na mono makaka ma me. Yasusaha na suusa kaka la we mu libanzi la me. Maasa paha na baa muutu nga imiinu!» <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomasi afutili nde: «Pfumu a me na Nzambi a me!» <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yisu aleeli nde: «Bu we miimono me, we miisa imiinu mu me? Kinya yili na bo baana ba baavelemono, ka bali mu usa imiinu!»<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yisu abwesa ŋa busu bu bayihi ba nde, biliimbu bya kimuhili, bi baavelesonehe mutso libuuku mo linili. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Ka mambu ma baasonehe hutso libuuku, baasonehe mo mana benu lisa imiinu ti Yisu ni Kristo. Nde ni Mwana a Nzambi. Na bu benu luusa imiinu, benu luubaha moonyi mu nduhi a nde.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu miimonehele huli bayihi ba nde hu dyanga la Tibelyade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Mwana a taangu yivyoho, Yisu abwemonehele huli bayihi ba nde ŋa muvanga a dyanga la Tibelyade. Mono buni nde hamonihili: <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoni Peetelo, Tomasi, nga kuumbu «Vasa», Natanayeli musi Kana hu Ngalili, baana ba Zebedayi na bayihi ba nde boole bakima, baakuukimi mbuha mosi. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoni Peetelo ayabisi bo: «Me kadwe hu ulobo.» Bo baaleeli nde: «Bisu kaka na we luuyene». Bo baayeni na baakoti mu luungu. Ka butsuhu mo buuna, bo a baabahi batswi ve.<verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Ŋa busi bwakiidi, Yisu aba ateleme ŋa simu la dyanga. Ka bayihi a baayaabi ti, wuuna aba ni Yisu ve. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Yisu afuuli bo: «Baana ba me, benu na byudya?» Bo baafutili nde: «Naana!» <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Nde aleeli bo: «Bwahaani lihi hu tsyelo a mbahala a luungu na benu sa libaha batswi.» Bu bo baabwahi lihi, bo a baatwali uduta lo ve, mu tooni a batswi bunzuhisini<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:4-7">Luk 5.4-7</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Na muyihi wu Yisu haba hatondo, ni uleele Peetelo: «Nde ni Pfumu!» Bu Simoni Peetelo hayuhi ti «nde ni Pfumu», nde apoti ikutu mu luungu la nde, mu tooni ati nde aba pene, na nde abwidi mu mamba. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Bayihi bana baayidi mu luungu, na ubaasamba mu lihi li laaba la luula mu batswi. Bo aba batahuha na simu, peleve mu kama (100) li mataka.<verse eid="JHN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Bu bo baatoodi ŋa simu, baasutihi, ŋaana bo baamoni mbaahu yi baaba baasuusala batswi na mapa. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yisu aleeli bo: «Behaani kabu li batswi mu baa benu limiibaha.» <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simoni Peetelo abwekoto mu luungu na aduti hu simu, lihi li laluula mu kama maku mataanu na batswi batatu (153) ba banene. Tso bu batswi baaba ba banzuhisini, lihi a laatudihi ve.<verse eid="JHN 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yisu aleeli bo: «Yadyaani.» Na tso mumosi mu bayihi a hatsimi mu ufuula nde ve: «We na we li?» Mu tooni ati, bo baaba bayaaba ti nde ni Pfumu. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yisu ayasusaha, avoli lipa, na akabili bo lo. Nde asiidi bumosi kaka mu batswi. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Liina aba aka ni monehele li matatu li Yisu hamonihili huli bayihi ba nde, umata bu nde hasuuhi mu babaakwa.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inoongi hya Peetelo na Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Bu bo baamani udya, Yisu aleeli huli Simoni Peetelo: «Simoni, mwaana a Yowani, we atondo me hwafulala bo baniiba?» Nde afutili: «Eye Pfumu, we yaabi ti me atondo we.» Yisu ni uleele nde: «Buungala bana ba me baa mameme!» <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Nde abweleele nde, leele la moole: «Simoni mwaana a Yowani, we atondo me?» Peetelo afutili: «Eye, Pfumu, we yaabi ti me atondo we.» Yisu ni uleele nde: «Keelese mameme ma me.» <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Nde ni ubweleele nde leele li mutatu: «Simoni, mwaana a Yowani, we atondo me?» Peetelo amoni lingebe bu Yisu haleeli nde, leele li mutatu: «We atondo me?» Na nde afutili: «Pfumu, we yabi mambu moosi. We yaabi ti me atondo we!» Yisu aleeli nde: «Buungala mameme ma me! <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Mu mbuli mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele we, ŋa we aba mufudu, we akahada we mwakulu mudi a lungu la we. We aba bunyanga mu uyene hu we akatondo. Ka ŋa we ka inunu, we sa baalaba myoho mya we, na muutu mukima sa ahada we nde, na sa abaabita we hu we aveletondo uyene.» <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Nde haleeli buuna, mu umweese buni Peetelo hafwana mu ukwa na uyuusa Nzambi mu kwili a nde. Titswene, Yisu aleeli nde: «Yaduukala me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:43">1.43</ref></char></note>!»<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu na muyihi wu nde hakatondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Peetelo akinguha, nde amoni ŋa mbisa a bo, muyihi wu Yisu haba hatondo, mu uduukala bo. Muyihi wu abaandimi ŋa tulu a Yisu na aleeli: «Pfumu, na wuuna wu usumbasa we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:25">13.25</ref></char></note>?» <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Bu Peetelo hamoni nde, nde aleeli Yisu: «Ka nde wunuuwu, Pfumu, hima hyuyiila nde?» <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yisu afutili nde: «Tso me tondi ti nde akwilala natee bu me unzapfutaha, ki lo litali we? Ka we, duukala me!» <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Ŋa yulu a ŋaana, tsangu yatsaamuhi ŋa hati la bana baa ngu ti muyihi mo wuuna a hukwa ve. Buuna, Yisu a haleeli huli Peetelo ti «nde a hukwa ve». Ka nde aleeli: «Tso me tondi ti, nde akwilala natee bu me unzapfutaha, ki lo litali we?»<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ni muyihi mo wunuuwu li mu uta imbangi mu mambu mo maniima, na ni nde asonehe mo. Na bisu liyaabi ti imbangi hya nde hili hya mbuli.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Yisu asiidi mambu makima ma malahi. Tso baayabisi mo limosi-limosi mu bisono, me tsimi ti tso toto yoosi a yaakikuhana mabuuku ma baakisonehe maana ve.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>